(391143, 34015, 9669, '<td valign="top">yes, good negative space, and the wood provides a great texture.  Good that the light off of the floor boards is not blown out so you can still see the wood grain.</td>', 'yes, good negative space, and the wood provides a great texture.  Good that the light off of the floor boards is not blown out so you can still see the wood grain.', '2003-08-18 04:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(391144, 33927, 9669, '<td valign="top">I know its a negative space competition, but I still want a little bit more of the dogs neck in it.  I love his look though.</td>', 'I know its a negative space competition, but I still want a little bit more of the dogs neck in it.  I love his look though.', '2003-08-18 04:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(391145, 33304, 9669, '<td valign="top">Great photo, perfect lighting.  The negative space isn''t really the clincher with this, but that doesn''t matter, its just a great photo.</td>', 'Great photo, perfect lighting.  The negative space isn''t really the clincher with this, but that doesn''t matter, its just a great photo.', '2003-08-18 04:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(391146, 34012, 5728, '<td valign="top">Go on, go and kiss ya self then! I gotta say this face looks familiar, that you Mav? Original mate - 9.</td>', 'Go on, go and kiss ya self then! I gotta say this face looks familiar, that you Mav? Original mate - 9.', '2003-08-18 04:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(391147, 33842, 9669, '<td valign="top">maybe if he was a little more inward of that top corner.. it would still be a great use of negative space.  Still, I love his expression-- doesn''t look too happy with you!</td>', 'maybe if he was a little more inward of that top corner.. it would still be a great use of negative space.  Still, I love his expression-- doesn''t look too happy with you!', '2003-08-18 04:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(391149, 33995, 9669, '<td valign="top">nice purple neg space.  Nice control of the lamp''s glare.  7</td>', 'nice purple neg space.  Nice control of the lamp''s glare.  7', '2003-08-18 04:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(391150, 33310, 8643, '<td valign="top">Maybe a laugh but not a picture.</td>', 'Maybe a laugh but not a picture.', '2003-08-18 04:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(391151, 34010, 9669, '<td valign="top">I can''t put my finger on it.  I think maybe if the negative space was ahead of them, in the direction they are facing, that might work better.  Nice catch though.</td>', 'I can''t put my finger on it.  I think maybe if the negative space was ahead of them, in the direction they are facing, that might work better.  Nice catch though.', '2003-08-18 04:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(391152, 33865, 9669, '<td valign="top">yes.  excellent negative space.  The sliver of land is just the right amount.  What it really needs though, is a little less brightness, for a bit more of a blue hue instead of white down low.  Just my pref though.  I like it.  Makes me feel like I''m cruising through Oklahoma</td>', 'yes.  excellent negative space.  The sliver of land is just the right amount.  What it really needs though, is a little less brightness, for a bit more of a blue hue instead of white down low.  Just my pref though.  I like it.  Makes me feel like I''m cruising through Oklahoma', '2003-08-18 04:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(391153, 33366, 9669, '<td valign="top">Its a very nice photograph, with great texture on that object.  I don''t really think the negative space has much of a role in this, but that doesn''t bother me.  6</td>', 'Its a very nice photograph, with great texture on that object.  I don''t really think the negative space has much of a role in this, but that doesn''t bother me.  6', '2003-08-18 04:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(391154, 33872, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and crisp. The white is so pure and highlights the red of the life saver very prominently. One of my favourites for the challenge - 10.</td>', 'Beautiful and crisp. The white is so pure and highlights the red of the life saver very prominently. One of my favourites for the challenge - 10.', '2003-08-18 04:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(391156, 33737, 9669, '<td valign="top">brilliant shades.  Brilliant contrast.  I like how the white crane has all neat, straight lines, contrasting with the dark chaotic smoke.</td>', 'brilliant shades.  Brilliant contrast.  I like how the white crane has all neat, straight lines, contrasting with the dark chaotic smoke.', '2003-08-18 04:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(391157, 34016, 9669, '<td valign="top">Its just so full.  Great photo.  Great colours, and excellent composition.  I''m sure people will be telling you that its not negative space, but who cares... its a great photo.</td>', 'Its just so full.  Great photo.  Great colours, and excellent composition.  I''m sure people will be telling you that its not negative space, but who cares... its a great photo.', '2003-08-18 04:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(391158, 33933, 5728, '<td valign="top">Kewl shot, I love the texture of the background and the composition is spot on. Now you got me craving for paua fritters. Something I haven''t had for years! (9)</td>', 'Kewl shot, I love the texture of the background and the composition is spot on. Now you got me craving for paua fritters. Something I haven''t had for years! (9)', '2003-08-18 04:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(391159, 33049, 9669, '<td valign="top">Great use of the IR with neg space for a dark feeling.  It is IR, isn''t it?</td>', 'Great use of the IR with neg space for a dark feeling.  It is IR, isn''t it?', '2003-08-18 04:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(391162, 34000, 8643, '<td valign="top">Just brilliant - has to a 10!</td>', 'Just brilliant - has to a 10!', '2003-08-18 05:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(391163, 33760, 8643, '<td valign="top">Very appealing - the skin tones against the stone colour, the upright shadow, motion captured, must be a winner - 10</td>', 'Very appealing - the skin tones against the stone colour, the upright shadow, motion captured, must be a winner - 10', '2003-08-18 05:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(391164, 34031, 8643, '<td valign="top">Love the colour, the composition, the stillness - 9</td>', 'Love the colour, the composition, the stillness - 9', '2003-08-18 05:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(391165, 33218, 8643, '<td valign="top">It''s that underwater camera again - stunning photo! - 9<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-08-25 04:20:33.</i></td>', 'It''s that underwater camera again - stunning photo! - 9', '2003-08-18 05:08:53.000000', '2003-08-25 05:20:33.000000', 1),
(391166, 33370, 10023, '<td valign="top">I think I would''ve preferred seeing only the coffee, now the light steals too much attention.</td>', 'I think I would''ve preferred seeing only the coffee, now the light steals too much attention.', '2003-08-18 05:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(391167, 33919, 8643, '<td valign="top">The lamp is over exposed, losing the point of a good idea - 4</td>', 'The lamp is over exposed, losing the point of a good idea - 4', '2003-08-18 05:10:39.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(391168, 33465, 8643, '<td valign="top">This is a nice portrait which would have been much better without the white frame - flash rarely produces a good portrait - this was so nearly there.</td>', 'This is a nice portrait which would have been much better without the white frame - flash rarely produces a good portrait - this was so nearly there.', '2003-08-18 05:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(391169, 33280, 10023, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. :)</td>', 'Nice idea. :)', '2003-08-18 05:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(391170, 33013, 5728, '<td valign="top">This pic is amazing, the B &amp; W and the composition and the blurred background all together make for an excellent photo. I would have given this a 10 immediately except for two things. The border doesn''t fit to the photo, it is distracting in a way and pulls my eyes from the beauty of your shot, this would have been far better without a border in my opinion. Also, (maybe I''m a little too picky now) the title is a bit unimaginative, but that isn''t a big problem for me :-)  (9)</td>', 'This pic is amazing, the B & W and the composition and the blurred background all together make for an excellent photo. I would have given this a 10 immediately except for two things. The border doesn''t fit to the photo, it is distracting in a way and pulls my eyes from the beauty of your shot, this would have been far better without a border in my opinion. Also, (maybe I''m a little too picky now) the title is a bit unimaginative, but that isn''t a big problem for me :-)  (9)', '2003-08-18 05:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(391171, 33822, 5728, '<td valign="top">Go Ben :-) Kewl how your hair just blends into the background. Original title n''all. You good man! (10)</td>', 'Go Ben :-) Kewl how your hair just blends into the background. Original title n''all. You good man! (10)', '2003-08-18 05:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(391172, 33218, 5728, '<td valign="top">Original photo, the composition is wonderful and the blue tones give this photo a soft feeling to it (9)</td>', 'Original photo, the composition is wonderful and the blue tones give this photo a soft feeling to it (9)', '2003-08-18 05:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(391173, 33737, 10023, '<td valign="top">This is inverted, right?</td>', 'This is inverted, right?', '2003-08-18 05:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(391174, 33224, 9669, '<td valign="top">great subject.  Might be better if it was less centered.</td>', 'great subject.  Might be better if it was less centered.', '2003-08-18 05:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(391175, 34029, 9669, '<td valign="top">very nice.  great blue colour.  Even a mountain can look small, with good use of negative space</td>', 'very nice.  great blue colour.  Even a mountain can look small, with good use of negative space', '2003-08-18 05:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(391176, 33747, 9669, '<td valign="top">I wonder who took this!!  Great composition.</td>', 'I wonder who took this!!  Great composition.', '2003-08-18 05:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(391177, 33583, 9669, '<td valign="top">beautiful.  Great fog that makes the negative space.  Nice colours</td>', 'beautiful.  Great fog that makes the negative space.  Nice colours', '2003-08-18 05:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(391178, 33417, 9669, '<td valign="top">very clever.</td>', 'very clever.', '2003-08-18 05:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(391179, 33903, 9669, '<td valign="top">great choice to aim for the stones.  Might be even better as a symmetrical shot, starting from the middle of the scene (just to the left).  I just say that because everything in the distance appears symmetrical.</td>', 'great choice to aim for the stones.  Might be even better as a symmetrical shot, starting from the middle of the scene (just to the left).  I just say that because everything in the distance appears symmetrical.', '2003-08-18 05:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(391180, 34009, 9669, '<td valign="top">shows that negative space does not mean a void!  excellent. Great limited DOF, focusing on the bird.  6</td>', 'shows that negative space does not mean a void!  excellent. Great limited DOF, focusing on the bird.  6', '2003-08-18 05:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(391181, 33893, 9669, '<td valign="top">better rotated 90 degrees?</td>', 'better rotated 90 degrees?', '2003-08-18 05:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(391182, 33747, 9550, '<td valign="top">Excllent Photo. The deep blue sky really makes the white come out.</td>', 'Excllent Photo. The deep blue sky really makes the white come out.', '2003-08-18 05:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(391183, 34028, 9669, '<td valign="top">very nice.  Great contrast and lighting on the fabric.  Nice subject-- something that has had a life, or some great use before the photo.</td>', 'very nice.  Great contrast and lighting on the fabric.  Nice subject-- something that has had a life, or some great use before the photo.', '2003-08-18 05:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(391184, 33835, 9669, '<td valign="top">great colours.  Great neg space</td>', 'great colours.  Great neg space', '2003-08-18 05:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(391185, 34022, 9550, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge well. A little to dark for me. I hope its not because of my monitor calibration. I really like the reflection on the water.</td>', 'Meets the challenge well. A little to dark for me. I hope its not because of my monitor calibration. I really like the reflection on the water.', '2003-08-18 05:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(391187, 33919, 9550, '<td valign="top">Meets the challeng well. I would have liked to seen a little more of an outline of the light bulb.</td>', 'Meets the challeng well. I would have liked to seen a little more of an outline of the light bulb.', '2003-08-18 05:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(391188, 34016, 9550, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, great angle, A light from the torch would have been even better.Excllent photo.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, great angle, A light from the torch would have been even better.Excllent photo.', '2003-08-18 05:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(391194, 33955, 9854, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling that the topic police will punish you for the breaks in your negative space. It is an excellent picture, however. And personally, I find it very much in keeping with the topic. The perspective is unusually interesting.</td>', 'I have a feeling that the topic police will punish you for the breaks in your negative space. It is an excellent picture, however. And personally, I find it very much in keeping with the topic. The perspective is unusually interesting.', '2003-08-18 06:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(391195, 33852, 9854, '<td valign="top">The parched clouds look like marble. Very nice negative space.</td>', 'The parched clouds look like marble. Very nice negative space.', '2003-08-18 06:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(391197, 33405, 9854, '<td valign="top">Being a scientist, I really love seeing this kind of stuff. The surface tension is so clear, it draws me out of the leaf!</td>', 'Being a scientist, I really love seeing this kind of stuff. The surface tension is so clear, it draws me out of the leaf!', '2003-08-18 06:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(391200, 34000, 9854, '<td valign="top">Stunning. I hope the guy''s still alive.</td>', 'Stunning. I hope the guy''s still alive.', '2003-08-18 06:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(391203, 34026, 9854, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective. Makes it look like a shot from above.</td>', 'Nice perspective. Makes it look like a shot from above.', '2003-08-18 06:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(391205, 33417, 9854, '<td valign="top">Brilliant! A touch of color (like on the champion logo) would have made it an even bigger wow picture.</td>', 'Brilliant! A touch of color (like on the champion logo) would have made it an even bigger wow picture.', '2003-08-18 06:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(391207, 33423, 9854, '<td valign="top">This is stunning! Just looking at the graffiti details make my hand sweat. Congrats.</td>', 'This is stunning! Just looking at the graffiti details make my hand sweat. Congrats.', '2003-08-18 06:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(391209, 33544, 9854, '<td valign="top">Nice. The faint kite thread however is neither here nor there. I''d rather have it completely disappear, or made completely obvious.</td>', 'Nice. The faint kite thread however is neither here nor there. I''d rather have it completely disappear, or made completely obvious.', '2003-08-18 06:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(391211, 33923, 9854, '<td valign="top">This has an understated elegance, as it plays around nicely with just a very limited palette of grays. I would have rated it really high were it not forprocessing artifacts, such as  the jaggies on the wing. It is still a 7 to me.</td>', 'This has an understated elegance, as it plays around nicely with just a very limited palette of grays. I would have rated it really high were it not forprocessing artifacts, such as  the jaggies on the wing. It is still a 7 to me.', '2003-08-18 06:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(391212, 33846, 9854, '<td valign="top">Nice. Boosting the saturation a bit to get greener slices would improve this pic to really appetizing levels.</td>', 'Nice. Boosting the saturation a bit to get greener slices would improve this pic to really appetizing levels.', '2003-08-18 06:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(391215, 33777, 4258, '<td valign="top">This is lovely, makes me want to pour hot tea in it - come to think of it this would be a killer shot if something was being poured [10] - Oops! not a member cant vote :(</td>', 'This is lovely, makes me want to pour hot tea in it - come to think of it this would be a killer shot if something was being poured [10] - Oops! not a member cant vote :(', '2003-08-18 06:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(391217, 33727, 4258, '<td valign="top">Neat Idea !!</td>', 'Neat Idea !!', '2003-08-18 06:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(391218, 33919, 4258, '<td valign="top">Your idea is bright but a wee bit tilted :)</td>', 'Your idea is bright but a wee bit tilted :)', '2003-08-18 06:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(391219, 33250, 9854, '<td valign="top">Personally, I think I would have shot this at a different angle, perhaps a higher or a lower vantage point. In that way, a complete reflection would have shown. Also, the black background is not too perfect. There is a faint red line that shows up right in the middle.</td>', 'Personally, I think I would have shot this at a different angle, perhaps a higher or a lower vantage point. In that way, a complete reflection would have shown. Also, the black background is not too perfect. There is a faint red line that shows up right in the middle.', '2003-08-18 06:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(391220, 33733, 9669, '<td valign="top">great silhouette</td>', 'great silhouette', '2003-08-18 06:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(391221, 33311, 9669, '<td valign="top">the colours really make this</td>', 'the colours really make this', '2003-08-18 06:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(391222, 33919, 9669, '<td valign="top">its a great idea.  Probably a good one for a sharp focus.</td>', 'its a great idea.  Probably a good one for a sharp focus.', '2003-08-18 06:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(391223, 33820, 9669, '<td valign="top">nice short dept of field.... what is it?</td>', 'nice short dept of field.... what is it?', '2003-08-18 06:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(391224, 33502, 9669, '<td valign="top">great subject.  Great photo.  Maybe even better if he was composed just a bit more to the right, further from the center.  just a bit.</td>', 'great subject.  Great photo.  Maybe even better if he was composed just a bit more to the right, further from the center.  just a bit.', '2003-08-18 06:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(391225, 33854, 9669, '<td valign="top">excellent use of neg space, to the fullest extent.  9</td>', 'excellent use of neg space, to the fullest extent.  9', '2003-08-18 06:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(391226, 33409, 9669, '<td valign="top">great silhouette.  The colours make me feel like I''m watching the northern lights! (or the southern lights in my case)</td>', 'great silhouette.  The colours make me feel like I''m watching the northern lights! (or the southern lights in my case)', '2003-08-18 06:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(391227, 33861, 9669, '<td valign="top">everybody takes photos out the window, but nobody takes them this well.  This is great.  Its a very nice light on light coloured photo.  Excellent composition.  9</td>', 'everybody takes photos out the window, but nobody takes them this well.  This is great.  Its a very nice light on light coloured photo.  Excellent composition.  9', '2003-08-18 06:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(391228, 33727, 9854, '<td valign="top">Clever. I prefer the glass to be not tilted, though. Or, to have at least the surface of the liquid to be horizontal (parallel to the real ground). Also, there''s a sticker on the glass that''s a little annoying once you notice it.</td>', 'Clever. I prefer the glass to be not tilted, though. Or, to have at least the surface of the liquid to be horizontal (parallel to the real ground). Also, there''s a sticker on the glass that''s a little annoying once you notice it.', '2003-08-18 06:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(391229, 33431, 4258, '<td valign="top">Nice, Infact very nice, would have prefered the backdrop to be jet black instead of olive green and looking creased. The lighting is very nice and so is the composition. Would love to see the outtakes on this one.</td>', 'Nice, Infact very nice, would have prefered the backdrop to be jet black instead of olive green and looking creased. The lighting is very nice and so is the composition. Would love to see the outtakes on this one.', '2003-08-18 06:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(391230, 33857, 9669, '<td valign="top">nice straight lines and geometric shapes.</td>', 'nice straight lines and geometric shapes.', '2003-08-18 06:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(391231, 34006, 9669, '<td valign="top">very nice.  Feels a bit grainy though</td>', 'very nice.  Feels a bit grainy though', '2003-08-18 06:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(391232, 34029, 9854, '<td valign="top">I like this style, but it is overdone. This is one of the more interesting ones, though.</td>', 'I like this style, but it is overdone. This is one of the more interesting ones, though.', '2003-08-18 06:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(391233, 33558, 9669, '<td valign="top">great.  Very nice use of the neg space</td>', 'great.  Very nice use of the neg space', '2003-08-18 06:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(391235, 33826, 9669, '<td valign="top">great neg space.  Nice composition.  I like how the surf forms a nice diagonal line that cuts across it.  Would have been great to get him focused.</td>', 'great neg space.  Nice composition.  I like how the surf forms a nice diagonal line that cuts across it.  Would have been great to get him focused.', '2003-08-18 06:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(391236, 33544, 9669, '<td valign="top">I love it.  maybe a bit better up further into the corner?  He''s looking down toward the bottom left, so his eyes might go better further to the upper right.  (just a tiny bit).  7</td>', 'I love it.  maybe a bit better up further into the corner?  He''s looking down toward the bottom left, so his eyes might go better further to the upper right.  (just a tiny bit).  7', '2003-08-18 07:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(391237, 33369, 9669, '<td valign="top">great contrast.  Nice subject.  I just have the urge to see more of it</td>', 'great contrast.  Nice subject.  I just have the urge to see more of it', '2003-08-18 07:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(391238, 33961, 9669, '<td valign="top">Great negative space.  I''ve been on here too long if I know who the photographer is by the subject.</td>', 'Great negative space.  I''ve been on here too long if I know who the photographer is by the subject.', '2003-08-18 07:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(391239, 34012, 9854, '<td valign="top">How many times did you have to run back and forth between the left and right sides of the frame? The vase isn''t perfectly symmetrical, but would still hold water. 6</td>', 'How many times did you have to run back and forth between the left and right sides of the frame? The vase isn''t perfectly symmetrical, but would still hold water. 6', '2003-08-18 07:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(391240, 33649, 9669, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  The contrast does it.  The water like reflection of the windows (glass??)  makes it a little surreal.  I love the gradient of greys from left to right on the sky as well.  8</td>', 'Great photo.  The contrast does it.  The water like reflection of the windows (glass??)  makes it a little surreal.  I love the gradient of greys from left to right on the sky as well.  8', '2003-08-18 07:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(391241, 33100, 9669, '<td valign="top">Nice.  You''ve shown that negative space does not just mean a void!  I think this would go well in "the past" challenge as well.   Nicely composed cityscape</td>', 'Nice.  You''ve shown that negative space does not just mean a void!  I think this would go well in "the past" challenge as well.   Nicely composed cityscape', '2003-08-18 07:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(391243, 33251, 9669, '<td valign="top">this is great.  Nice simple curves, nice contrast.  8</td>', 'this is great.  Nice simple curves, nice contrast.  8', '2003-08-18 07:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(391245, 33587, 9854, '<td valign="top">I tried looking at this picture upside down, and the result is pretty interesting. It looks like a schematic diagram for some funky do-it-yourself furniture. Really nice, interesting pic - viewed sideways, upside down, or as it is. How many pictures can look that good when viewed from all sides :) ?</td>', 'I tried looking at this picture upside down, and the result is pretty interesting. It looks like a schematic diagram for some funky do-it-yourself furniture. Really nice, interesting pic - viewed sideways, upside down, or as it is. How many pictures can look that good when viewed from all sides :) ?', '2003-08-18 07:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(391246, 33370, 9669, '<td valign="top">This is great!  (not you Tarique, is it?).  This is real top stuff.  The only thing I can think of, is having that slight glare bump on top of the light circle (on the top) removed.  I only say that, because the rest of it is made of of very clean, smooth, geometric shapes.  The symmetry works well with this too.  9</td>', 'This is great!  (not you Tarique, is it?).  This is real top stuff.  The only thing I can think of, is having that slight glare bump on top of the light circle (on the top) removed.  I only say that, because the rest of it is made of of very clean, smooth, geometric shapes.  The symmetry works well with this too.  9', '2003-08-18 07:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(391247, 33651, 9669, '<td valign="top">nice subject.  Might work better if it was not centered along the bottom.  Maybe just a bit to the left?</td>', 'nice subject.  Might work better if it was not centered along the bottom.  Maybe just a bit to the left?', '2003-08-18 07:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
