(391261, 34014, 9669, '<td valign="top">This is classic.  what makes it even better, is that the TV is only static.  Perfectly simple.  The wall looks dirty, the floor looks dirty, and your beer box is makeshift furniture.  This works well centered too.  This is a hands down 10 in my book.</td>', 'This is classic.  what makes it even better, is that the TV is only static.  Perfectly simple.  The wall looks dirty, the floor looks dirty, and your beer box is makeshift furniture.  This works well centered too.  This is a hands down 10 in my book.', '2003-08-18 07:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
