(391320, 33651, 9854, '<td valign="top">The center-haters will rate you down a notch or two for the boat''s position. But I think it is visually pleasing that way. It''s not my kind of beach, but the boat makes it look good to me.</td>', 'The center-haters will rate you down a notch or two for the boat''s position. But I think it is visually pleasing that way. It''s not my kind of beach, but the boat makes it look good to me.', '2003-08-18 08:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(391322, 33252, 9854, '<td valign="top">Great-looking fly! Even the pollen grains are sharp. Nice capture.</td>', 'Great-looking fly! Even the pollen grains are sharp. Nice capture.', '2003-08-18 08:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(391323, 33431, 9854, '<td valign="top">Now now.... how should I rate this? The prints on the gauze look superfluous, so I have to subtract 0.05. Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Now now.... how should I rate this? The prints on the gauze look superfluous, so I have to subtract 0.05. Beautiful shot.', '2003-08-18 08:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(391325, 33323, 9854, '<td valign="top">Now that''s the smallest negative space in this collection of entries. I like how you formed an entirely new focal point out of blurred space.</td>', 'Now that''s the smallest negative space in this collection of entries. I like how you formed an entirely new focal point out of blurred space.', '2003-08-18 09:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(391326, 33893, 9854, '<td valign="top">Reminiscent of ikebana. Nice composition, but overprocessed. The branches appear jagged.</td>', 'Reminiscent of ikebana. Nice composition, but overprocessed. The branches appear jagged.', '2003-08-18 09:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(391336, 33366, 9913, '<td valign="top">Cool pipe!</td>', 'Cool pipe!', '2003-08-18 09:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(391338, 33448, 9295, '<td valign="top">Every once in awhile, the camera manages to capture something truly wonderous and this is definitely one of those shots. Not only have you taken my breath away with the beauty of your obvious center of focus, but you have captivated my imagination as I study the clouds at the top of the frame and see the "angel" watching over this lonely little grave. I think the sepia works wonderfully here, disallowing color to detract from these amazing images. The ONLY distraction I see is the very small silhouette in the bottom left corner of the frame which can be easily tweaked out with post-processing techniques. All in all, a terrific use of negative space. A 10 from me  (if only I could vote).</td>', 'Every once in awhile, the camera manages to capture something truly wonderous and this is definitely one of those shots. Not only have you taken my breath away with the beauty of your obvious center of focus, but you have captivated my imagination as I study the clouds at the top of the frame and see the "angel" watching over this lonely little grave. I think the sepia works wonderfully here, disallowing color to detract from these amazing images. The ONLY distraction I see is the very small silhouette in the bottom left corner of the frame which can be easily tweaked out with post-processing techniques. All in all, a terrific use of negative space. A 10 from me  (if only I could vote).', '2003-08-18 09:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(391339, 33629, 9295, '<td valign="top">I liked this as a thumbnail which is why I opened it up larger to comment on it (I can''t vote). I was a little disappointed that the grasshopper''s body is not in focus, but I suppose that''s either intentional or unavoidable given his...er...pose (do grasshoppers pose? LOL).  Anyway, I love his placement on the page, the way he is looking straight on into the camera, the soft reflection underneath him and definitely your use of negative space.  Cool picture. Thanks.</td>', 'I liked this as a thumbnail which is why I opened it up larger to comment on it (I can''t vote). I was a little disappointed that the grasshopper''s body is not in focus, but I suppose that''s either intentional or unavoidable given his...er...pose (do grasshoppers pose? LOL).  Anyway, I love his placement on the page, the way he is looking straight on into the camera, the soft reflection underneath him and definitely your use of negative space.  Cool picture. Thanks.', '2003-08-18 09:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(391340, 33961, 9295, '<td valign="top">I liked this shot as a thumbnail, but opening it up, I''m even more curious about it.  I figured it was a janitor cleaning up a parking lot, but this person''s clothing and helmet suggest something more. He almost looks like a racer of some kind, which makes the idea of him tidying up a little more intriguing.  What is he cleaning up?  Debris from a crash?  Is he a motorcyclist cleaning up stuff from the track that might cause a crash? You have taken your interpretation of negative space to create a picture for the imagination to fill in the blanks.  Always my favorite kind of shot.</td>', 'I liked this shot as a thumbnail, but opening it up, I''m even more curious about it.  I figured it was a janitor cleaning up a parking lot, but this person''s clothing and helmet suggest something more. He almost looks like a racer of some kind, which makes the idea of him tidying up a little more intriguing.  What is he cleaning up?  Debris from a crash?  Is he a motorcyclist cleaning up stuff from the track that might cause a crash? You have taken your interpretation of negative space to create a picture for the imagination to fill in the blanks.  Always my favorite kind of shot.', '2003-08-18 09:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(391344, 33583, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites of the challenge.  Absolutely beautiful in every way.  The placement on the page, the softness of the center branch in the background, the sharp focus of those in the fore, the perfect lighting...but most of all, that splendid contrast of the red against all the different shades of green.  Just fantastic.  A 10 from me if I could give you a vote!!</td>', 'This is one of my favorites of the challenge.  Absolutely beautiful in every way.  The placement on the page, the softness of the center branch in the background, the sharp focus of those in the fore, the perfect lighting...but most of all, that splendid contrast of the red against all the different shades of green.  Just fantastic.  A 10 from me if I could give you a vote!!', '2003-08-18 09:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(391346, 33919, 9295, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot but the lightbulb, unfortunately, gets lost in the white background.  Wouldn''t it be fun if it was yellow?  Also, the focus on your subject seems just a little soft.  For this photo, I think the crisper the better.  Very humorous and original though.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot but the lightbulb, unfortunately, gets lost in the white background.  Wouldn''t it be fun if it was yellow?  Also, the focus on your subject seems just a little soft.  For this photo, I think the crisper the better.  Very humorous and original though.', '2003-08-18 09:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(391347, 33234, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice Bonsai, looks like a Fukien Tea.  This would be much improved if it wasn''t sitting dead center in the frame.  Moved over to the left and take out the rising slope there would have been much more dramatic.  Good shot.</td>', 'Nice Bonsai, looks like a Fukien Tea.  This would be much improved if it wasn''t sitting dead center in the frame.  Moved over to the left and take out the rising slope there would have been much more dramatic.  Good shot.', '2003-08-18 09:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(391348, 33431, 9295, '<td valign="top">Beautifully artistic. The lighting is perfect and the shroud adds a wonderful softness to her form. This is a terrific example of not only negative space but of nude photography.</td>', 'Beautifully artistic. The lighting is perfect and the shroud adds a wonderful softness to her form. This is a terrific example of not only negative space but of nude photography.', '2003-08-18 09:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(391350, 33628, 11243, '<td valign="top">interesting, the background really seems to grab you..</td>', 'interesting, the background really seems to grab you..', '2003-08-18 09:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(391352, 34010, 9854, '<td valign="top">Superb capture!</td>', 'Superb capture!', '2003-08-18 09:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(391353, 33310, 8860, '<td valign="top">Ok. Here it comes! <br/> <br/>Focus is a little off and the composition is quite dreadful. Despite those small details the bear is indeed jet black and the night is indeed very dark, with no moon, stars, light pollution or any ambient light whatsoever. How the f**k did you find your way home?<br/></td>', 'Ok. Here it comes!  Focus is a little off and the composition is quite dreadful. Despite those small details the bear is indeed jet black and the night is indeed very dark, with no moon, stars, light pollution or any ambient light whatsoever. How the f**k did you find your way home?', '2003-08-18 09:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(391354, 33729, 9854, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a very high f stop would have given you a much darker, and more uniform negative space than what you have now. Still, a good shot.</td>', 'Perhaps a very high f stop would have given you a much darker, and more uniform negative space than what you have now. Still, a good shot.', '2003-08-18 09:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(391359, 33893, 8860, '<td valign="top">Image looks a bit too treated for me and the border and ''glow'' spoil what would be a good, simple composition. Branch &amp; border have too much saturation of blue &amp; magenta making it look harsh.</td>', 'Image looks a bit too treated for me and the border and ''glow'' spoil what would be a good, simple composition. Branch & border have too much saturation of blue & magenta making it look harsh.', '2003-08-18 10:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(391365, 33923, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is far too shrouded by grey midtones to retain any interest. It looks like an interesting subject with detail but it is lost with the reduction in the contrast and saturation.</td>', 'This is far too shrouded by grey midtones to retain any interest. It looks like an interesting subject with detail but it is lost with the reduction in the contrast and saturation.', '2003-08-18 10:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(391367, 33979, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good capture and a fair composition too. It would have been nice to see more of the gull, although the angle does minimise its profile which actually assits the composition.</td>', 'Good capture and a fair composition too. It would have been nice to see more of the gull, although the angle does minimise its profile which actually assits the composition.', '2003-08-18 10:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(391368, 33448, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent work :)  I love the emotive value of this photograph.  This is one of the strongest images in this challenge.  The sun beams punching through the clouds behind the cross makes this photograph ''speak'' in a very strong tone.  What this photo is ''saying'' could be interpreted several different ways as well :)  Kudos on a beautiful photo... (comment #6000 for setzler) :D = 10</td>', 'Excellent work :)  I love the emotive value of this photograph.  This is one of the strongest images in this challenge.  The sun beams punching through the clouds behind the cross makes this photograph ''speak'' in a very strong tone.  What this photo is ''saying'' could be interpreted several different ways as well :)  Kudos on a beautiful photo... (comment #6000 for setzler) :D = 10', '2003-08-18 10:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(391371, 33873, 8860, '<td valign="top">It''s a lovely scene but the border is a bit overkill. Perhaps a little too much space filled for me and the saturation is spilling over a bit, creating a bit of noise. Great composition.</td>', 'It''s a lovely scene but the border is a bit overkill. Perhaps a little too much space filled for me and the saturation is spilling over a bit, creating a bit of noise. Great composition.', '2003-08-18 10:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(391374, 34010, 8860, '<td valign="top">Border overpowers this delicate image. A very good composition with excellent focus given the capture. Fills the brief nicely too.</td>', 'Border overpowers this delicate image. A very good composition with excellent focus given the capture. Fills the brief nicely too.', '2003-08-18 10:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(391376, 33234, 8860, '<td valign="top">Composition too central for me. I think the feeling of space is lacking due to the bonsai being ''framed'' by the landscape around it. An off-centre position (try blocking the overpowering left side out of vision - it looks better) would have improved this.</td>', 'Composition too central for me. I think the feeling of space is lacking due to the bonsai being ''framed'' by the landscape around it. An off-centre position (try blocking the overpowering left side out of vision - it looks better) would have improved this.', '2003-08-18 10:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(391377, 33891, 8860, '<td valign="top">You have left a large block of black to the right of this image which artificially increases your negative space. A nice shot if this were the genuine composition.</td>', 'You have left a large block of black to the right of this image which artificially increases your negative space. A nice shot if this were the genuine composition.', '2003-08-18 10:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(391380, 33049, 8860, '<td valign="top">Like the design in this. Very smart. Good composition and ''probably'' a good use of levels or else a nuke has gone off behind you! Border is a bit apologetic though - I''d lose it! [8]</td>', 'Like the design in this. Very smart. Good composition and ''probably'' a good use of levels or else a nuke has gone off behind you! Border is a bit apologetic though - I''d lose it! [8]', '2003-08-18 10:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
