(391411, 34014, 2337, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling this will be overlooked by the ''artsy'' folks, but this is one of the best I''ve seen this week.  Definitely tells a story and that story is told largely by the negetive space.  I hope this scores as well as it deserves, but frankly I think it will go over most folks head...  Great work... ~10~</td>', 'I have a feeling this will be overlooked by the ''artsy'' folks, but this is one of the best I''ve seen this week.  Definitely tells a story and that story is told largely by the negetive space.  I hope this scores as well as it deserves, but frankly I think it will go over most folks head...  Great work... ~10~', '2003-08-18 10:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
