(391580, 33979, 8779, '<td valign="top">I love the sky! Brilliant colors. However, the subject is less interesting as it is a little too dark and small to see and almost fades into the grey clouds. I know it is impossible to put the bird where you would like, I would have much prefered seeing more light on the bird and non of that grey cloud stuff. =)</td>', 'I love the sky! Brilliant colors. However, the subject is less interesting as it is a little too dark and small to see and almost fades into the grey clouds. I know it is impossible to put the bird where you would like, I would have much prefered seeing more light on the bird and non of that grey cloud stuff. =)', '2003-08-18 12:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(391585, 33978, 8779, '<td valign="top">Amazing. I love the light from the small holes. However, just the tiniest niggle... That ''grill'' that I see on the right, it''s a little off putting. Perhaps it could have been cropped off?</td>', 'Amazing. I love the light from the small holes. However, just the tiniest niggle... That ''grill'' that I see on the right, it''s a little off putting. Perhaps it could have been cropped off?', '2003-08-18 12:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
