(391587, 33889, 9854, '<td valign="top">Great composition. I am a little distracted by the digital artifacts, however. Aside from the grainy dark areas, on the lower left, I see parallel white lines that shouldn''t be there.</td>', 'Great composition. I am a little distracted by the digital artifacts, however. Aside from the grainy dark areas, on the lower left, I see parallel white lines that shouldn''t be there.', '2003-08-18 12:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(391589, 33457, 8779, '<td valign="top">Brilliant building. And all the detail captured sharply.<br/> <br/>But being a perfectionist, when you hold up a ruler to the line on the arc then trace it upwards, you will see that it is not align with the two circles of the roof decoration. I am so sorry, but I cannot help but notice! However, great image still!</td>', 'Brilliant building. And all the detail captured sharply. But being a perfectionist, when you hold up a ruler to the line on the arc then trace it upwards, you will see that it is not align with the two circles of the roof decoration. I am so sorry, but I cannot help but notice! However, great image still!', '2003-08-18 12:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(391600, 33957, 8779, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of subjects. However, firstly, I''d have liked to see the green fatboy sign the right way around. I can see that you liked the bulbs, but if so, try to make it clear by perhaps cropping closer to the subject or bluring the background with a wider aperture.<br/> <br/>The background is very discracting and doesnt really make me go WOW. <br/> <br/>However, these are only my opinions and suggestions. =)</td>', 'Interesting choice of subjects. However, firstly, I''d have liked to see the green fatboy sign the right way around. I can see that you liked the bulbs, but if so, try to make it clear by perhaps cropping closer to the subject or bluring the background with a wider aperture. The background is very discracting and doesnt really make me go WOW.  However, these are only my opinions and suggestions. =)', '2003-08-18 12:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
