(391633, 33955, 8779, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but I do not see how the father and son links in with the beautiful blue ocea with lots of people swimming in it.<br/> <br/>Loving the blue, it would have been great if perhaps you homed in on a chosen group of people/person close enough to see details but keeping lots the blue all around. =)</td>', 'Interesting idea, but I do not see how the father and son links in with the beautiful blue ocea with lots of people swimming in it. Loving the blue, it would have been great if perhaps you homed in on a chosen group of people/person close enough to see details but keeping lots the blue all around. =)', '2003-08-18 13:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(391634, 33727, 2752, '<td valign="top">the lighting enhances the photo..I like the way the light outlines the rim of the top glass...I think I would have removed the semi transparent label. ..the angles of the glasses and the diagonal add to the the shot nicely.(7)</td>', 'the lighting enhances the photo..I like the way the light outlines the rim of the top glass...I think I would have removed the semi transparent label. ..the angles of the glasses and the diagonal add to the the shot nicely.(7)', '2003-08-18 13:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(391635, 33554, 8779, '<td valign="top">I see that you have chosen grass as your space, but take a look for yourself. Does the grass make that ornament WOW? and then ask yourself why.<br/> <br/>I think that the grass if firstly too distracting. Perhaps you could have used a wider aperture to blur out the grass. And secondly, the colour of the grass if fairly similar to the shades on the stone and therefore not much contrast. Personally, I''d have liked to see you choose a different background. =)<br/> <br/>Also, it would have been nice to see the ornament in the middle of the image =)</td>', 'I see that you have chosen grass as your space, but take a look for yourself. Does the grass make that ornament WOW? and then ask yourself why. I think that the grass if firstly too distracting. Perhaps you could have used a wider aperture to blur out the grass. And secondly, the colour of the grass if fairly similar to the shades on the stone and therefore not much contrast. Personally, I''d have liked to see you choose a different background. =) Also, it would have been nice to see the ornament in the middle of the image =)', '2003-08-18 13:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
