(391909, 34028, 5112, '<td valign="top">Frisca''s entry?  I really like this picture, it has a softness about it that''s very attractive.  It makes me want to touch that fabric, it looks like such soft cotton.  The beadwork is nice.  Actually, the negative space is wonderful and really makes this picture.  One of my favourites this challenge.  ~10</td>', 'Frisca''s entry?  I really like this picture, it has a softness about it that''s very attractive.  It makes me want to touch that fabric, it looks like such soft cotton.  The beadwork is nice.  Actually, the negative space is wonderful and really makes this picture.  One of my favourites this challenge.  ~10', '2003-08-18 16:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
