(391932, 33760, 5112, '<td valign="top">Excellent entry, very good example of negative space making the "wow" of the picture!  The tones are wonderful.  One of my favourites.  ~10</td>', 'Excellent entry, very good example of negative space making the "wow" of the picture!  The tones are wonderful.  One of my favourites.  ~10', '2003-08-18 16:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
