(391941, 34014, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice image, nice use of negative space. I think the white noise on the screen is also a nice touch, gives a bit more feel to the shot.</td>', 'Nice image, nice use of negative space. I think the white noise on the screen is also a nice touch, gives a bit more feel to the shot.', '2003-08-18 16:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(391943, 34017, 10643, '<td valign="top">I don''t see any negative space in this image; the subject fills the frame very nicely. It''s a good shot, and I hope it''s a stuffed crocodile not a real one, but it doesn''t seem to fit the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t see any negative space in this image; the subject fills the frame very nicely. It''s a good shot, and I hope it''s a stuffed crocodile not a real one, but it doesn''t seem to fit the challenge.', '2003-08-18 16:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(391945, 33873, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very nice silhouette and sunset!  IMO, and that''s just my opinion, a less prominent border would enhance the picture; it''s such a beautiful picture, it doesn''t need such a heavy border.  ~9</td>', 'Very nice silhouette and sunset!  IMO, and that''s just my opinion, a less prominent border would enhance the picture; it''s such a beautiful picture, it doesn''t need such a heavy border.  ~9', '2003-08-18 16:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(391949, 34001, 10643, '<td valign="top">Without the title, it would be difficult to know what this was a picture of. A little fill lighting in the foreground and a composition that didn''t include the tree would be much more striking. It''s definitely an interesting way to look at a walk/don''t walk sign, and you caught a great day for sky photos.</td>', 'Without the title, it would be difficult to know what this was a picture of. A little fill lighting in the foreground and a composition that didn''t include the tree would be much more striking. It''s definitely an interesting way to look at a walk/don''t walk sign, and you caught a great day for sky photos.', '2003-08-18 16:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(391952, 33452, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset, great colours!  It''s a bit hard to tell which is negative space as the mountains/sun are not in focus.</td>', 'Beautiful sunset, great colours!  It''s a bit hard to tell which is negative space as the mountains/sun are not in focus.', '2003-08-18 16:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(391955, 33049, 6870, '<td valign="top">Infrared works well here. Good choice!</td>', 'Infrared works well here. Good choice!', '2003-08-18 16:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(391956, 33926, 6870, '<td valign="top">LOvely idea and title. The gradual lightening of the image toward the top works well to imply many things. THumb is a little dark, but that''s nitpicky!</td>', 'LOvely idea and title. The gradual lightening of the image toward the top works well to imply many things. THumb is a little dark, but that''s nitpicky!', '2003-08-18 16:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(391957, 33919, 6870, '<td valign="top">Oops, it looks like my shot is similar to yours! Oh well. I do like yours a lot, and the light bulb adds a hint of whimsy to it. Did you try against a black background to make the light bulb stand out more?</td>', 'Oops, it looks like my shot is similar to yours! Oh well. I do like yours a lot, and the light bulb adds a hint of whimsy to it. Did you try against a black background to make the light bulb stand out more?', '2003-08-18 16:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(391958, 34019, 3554, '<td valign="top">I think the subject is the picnic table, so the negative space is the grass around the table which isn''t nearly as interesting as the sky. I don''t see the sky as "negative space" because it''s not what surrounds the subject.</td>', 'I think the subject is the picnic table, so the negative space is the grass around the table which isn''t nearly as interesting as the sky. I don''t see the sky as "negative space" because it''s not what surrounds the subject.', '2003-08-18 16:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(391960, 33586, 6870, '<td valign="top">Neg space here implies a further universe, which is appropriate... Have you tried with the moon in the upper third?</td>', 'Neg space here implies a further universe, which is appropriate... Have you tried with the moon in the upper third?', '2003-08-18 16:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(391961, 33597, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that the mother in the background is ''negative space'' as there is something in it that is very interesting. This is a masterful photograph. 7</td>', 'I''m not sure that the mother in the background is ''negative space'' as there is something in it that is very interesting. This is a masterful photograph. 7', '2003-08-18 16:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(391962, 34006, 6870, '<td valign="top">Cool eyeball. Neg space is white--have you tried black to add mystery with this weird eyebal?</td>', 'Cool eyeball. Neg space is white--have you tried black to add mystery with this weird eyebal?', '2003-08-18 16:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(391963, 33367, 3554, '<td valign="top">I dont really see the negative space as being the strength of this shot. The horizon seems "tilted" and the sky is overexposed on the right.</td>', 'I dont really see the negative space as being the strength of this shot. The horizon seems "tilted" and the sky is overexposed on the right.', '2003-08-18 16:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(391966, 33756, 6870, '<td valign="top">Kiss me! Mwaaw! Now I''m a prince--what? I''m NOT a prince? No wonder I''m grumpy! Neg space does not add grumpiness,but it does imply that the toad is part of a larger space. Is that sand he/she is on? I somehow wish it were more toad-environment-like. Oh well. Nice shot! 8</td>', 'Kiss me! Mwaaw! Now I''m a prince--what? I''m NOT a prince? No wonder I''m grumpy! Neg space does not add grumpiness,but it does imply that the toad is part of a larger space. Is that sand he/she is on? I somehow wish it were more toad-environment-like. Oh well. Nice shot! 8', '2003-08-18 16:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(391967, 34022, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love the dark tones here. Neg space implies a world of mystery and joy. Nicely done.</td>', 'I love the dark tones here. Neg space implies a world of mystery and joy. Nicely done.', '2003-08-18 16:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(391972, 33832, 6870, '<td valign="top">NIce placement of singer. I like the dark neg space which implies to me, oddly, that she is alone--or at least that she is alone with her music. Nice.</td>', 'NIce placement of singer. I like the dark neg space which implies to me, oddly, that she is alone--or at least that she is alone with her music. Nice.', '2003-08-18 16:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(391975, 33409, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wow, just look at all that strength floating around in that negative space! Swell!</td>', 'Wow, just look at all that strength floating around in that negative space! Swell!', '2003-08-18 16:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(391978, 33954, 6870, '<td valign="top">Appropriate and fun! Neg space remains negative even though the clouds are very interesting.</td>', 'Appropriate and fun! Neg space remains negative even though the clouds are very interesting.', '2003-08-18 16:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(391979, 33138, 6870, '<td valign="top">NIce detail on the dragonfly. MOving to one of the thirds would have give a more obvious negative space, and would have hinted at the world of the dragonfly in addition to the insect itself.</td>', 'NIce detail on the dragonfly. MOving to one of the thirds would have give a more obvious negative space, and would have hinted at the world of the dragonfly in addition to the insect itself.', '2003-08-18 16:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(391981, 33829, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice tones but especially nice textures captured here. Negative space works well to imply more flower.</td>', 'Nice tones but especially nice textures captured here. Negative space works well to imply more flower.', '2003-08-18 16:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(391988, 33951, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and moth detail! Making the moth smaller and moving to one of the thirds would add more obvious negative space (but you''d lose some of the detail). It would also help the negative space imply the world the moth is a part of. This is a nice insect shot!</td>', 'Nice colors and moth detail! Making the moth smaller and moving to one of the thirds would add more obvious negative space (but you''d lose some of the detail). It would also help the negative space imply the world the moth is a part of. This is a nice insect shot!', '2003-08-18 16:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(391992, 33955, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting and engaging shot! the background puzzles me as it should, but remains negative space. Expression on baby is priceless!</td>', 'Interesting and engaging shot! the background puzzles me as it should, but remains negative space. Expression on baby is priceless!', '2003-08-18 16:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(391999, 33280, 6870, '<td valign="top">I somehow find this shot humorous. The neg space is there and close cropping works. A higher vantage point, which would have probably been impossible without ladder or tree, would emphasize this neg space even more and add to the drama of the distance and accuracy of her shot.</td>', 'I somehow find this shot humorous. The neg space is there and close cropping works. A higher vantage point, which would have probably been impossible without ladder or tree, would emphasize this neg space even more and add to the drama of the distance and accuracy of her shot.', '2003-08-18 16:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(392000, 33753, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really interesting perspective here. I didn''t know what these were right at first, and it''s ironic how the markers turn into post-like objects as they get farther away--and puzzlingly--more in focus.</td>', 'Really interesting perspective here. I didn''t know what these were right at first, and it''s ironic how the markers turn into post-like objects as they get farther away--and puzzlingly--more in focus.', '2003-08-18 16:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(392013, 33345, 2567, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites.  Composition very nice.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites.  Composition very nice.  Good luck.', '2003-08-18 16:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(392052, 33737, 7350, '<td valign="top">Nice "negative" inversion of the colors.  I think it works great for this challenge.</td>', 'Nice "negative" inversion of the colors.  I think it works great for this challenge.', '2003-08-18 17:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(392053, 33448, 1368, '<td valign="top">Oh my! Its goergous! Awesome sky And the cross adds the right thing to it! Great job! Congratulations!</td>', 'Oh my! Its goergous! Awesome sky And the cross adds the right thing to it! Great job! Congratulations!', '2003-08-18 17:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(392054, 34029, 7350, '<td valign="top">A perfect 10 in my book.</td>', 'A perfect 10 in my book.', '2003-08-18 17:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(392055, 33889, 1368, '<td valign="top">Great picture! Love the V- lines there on the roof And the sepia color. Great job! :)</td>', 'Great picture! Love the V- lines there on the roof And the sepia color. Great job! :)', '2003-08-18 17:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(392057, 34019, 1368, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture! The sky is great! Looks very icelandic? :o Good job :)</td>', 'Beautiful picture! The sky is great! Looks very icelandic? :o Good job :)', '2003-08-18 17:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(392059, 33423, 1368, '<td valign="top">Wow! What a cool thing!!! Great picture I love it!</td>', 'Wow! What a cool thing!!! Great picture I love it!', '2003-08-18 17:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(392060, 33431, 1368, '<td valign="top">This is very beautiful! The greenish color makes it look almost like an old painting Great job :)</td>', 'This is very beautiful! The greenish color makes it look almost like an old painting Great job :)', '2003-08-18 17:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(392062, 34000, 3102, '<td valign="top">What a great shot!  I''m banking on this one to get a ribbon.  You caught it at a great spot -- not an easy one to capture!  - 10</td>', 'What a great shot!  I''m banking on this one to get a ribbon.  You caught it at a great spot -- not an easy one to capture!  - 10', '2003-08-18 17:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(392063, 33861, 1368, '<td valign="top">Wow! How did you capture that?! This is great work! Beautiful blue color and perfect focus Hope nobody got hurt while taking this picture ;) Great job!</td>', 'Wow! How did you capture that?! This is great work! Beautiful blue color and perfect focus Hope nobody got hurt while taking this picture ;) Great job!', '2003-08-18 17:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(392065, 34015, 1368, '<td valign="top">This picture is soo cool! I absolutely love the floor here and the shadows are great! Great job!</td>', 'This picture is soo cool! I absolutely love the floor here and the shadows are great! Great job!', '2003-08-18 17:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(392066, 33760, 1368, '<td valign="top">This is awesome! Great shadow! Great perspective! Great negative space! Great job! :)</td>', 'This is awesome! Great shadow! Great perspective! Great negative space! Great job! :)', '2003-08-18 17:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(392073, 33861, 7350, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Crisp, clear, and well composed.</td>', 'Very nice.  Crisp, clear, and well composed.', '2003-08-18 18:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(392101, 33978, 10643, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. You can almost imagine the group of people sitting just outside the range of the fire''s light. The star effect on the light and the shapes of the flames are really striking. Nice job!</td>', 'This is beautiful. You can almost imagine the group of people sitting just outside the range of the fire''s light. The star effect on the light and the shapes of the flames are really striking. Nice job!', '2003-08-18 18:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(392103, 34000, 10643, '<td valign="top">finally one with the subject at the top and the negative space at the bottom. :) a unique and arresting shot, great job!</td>', 'finally one with the subject at the top and the negative space at the bottom. :) a unique and arresting shot, great job!', '2003-08-18 18:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(392122, 33865, 7350, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of the cow shot from the first Negative Space challenge.  I still like it. 8.</td>', 'This reminds me of the cow shot from the first Negative Space challenge.  I still like it. 8.', '2003-08-18 19:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(392123, 33955, 8522, '<td valign="top">Uncomfortable with existing artwork. Also, your negative space has too much in it for my taste. 1</td>', 'Uncomfortable with existing artwork. Also, your negative space has too much in it for my taste. 1', '2003-08-18 19:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
