(392424, 33175, 6888, '<td valign="top">i think that this is way too busy to be considered negative space</td>', 'i think that this is way too busy to be considered negative space', '2003-08-19 01:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(392426, 33014, 6888, '<td valign="top">much too busy to be considered negative space</td>', 'much too busy to be considered negative space', '2003-08-19 01:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(392427, 33311, 6888, '<td valign="top">much too busy to be considered negative space</td>', 'much too busy to be considered negative space', '2003-08-19 01:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(392428, 33583, 4514, '<td valign="top">Hello.  I think the Fog/cloudyness is wonderful.  I do enjoy looking at this shot, but there is something that is missing and I am having a problem putting my finger on it.<br/>The focus is wonderful, but there is something missing with the lighting and the color.  I think the idea is great but, just underdeveloped in some aspect for some reason.  <br/> <br/>John (TurboTech)</td>', 'Hello.  I think the Fog/cloudyness is wonderful.  I do enjoy looking at this shot, but there is something that is missing and I am having a problem putting my finger on it.The focus is wonderful, but there is something missing with the lighting and the color.  I think the idea is great but, just underdeveloped in some aspect for some reason.   John (TurboTech)', '2003-08-19 01:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(392433, 34025, 4514, '<td valign="top">Greetings.  I would like to start out by saying nice use of frame here.  I am sure you are getting many "Its not in Focus"  I will not pick on that directly here.  One question I have is as follows.  Is the spiral peice of metal in the same plane or does it have depth?  Either way I think there are several applications that could be applied.<br/> <br/>Thank you for your time.  <br/> <br/>John (TurboTech)</td>', 'Greetings.  I would like to start out by saying nice use of frame here.  I am sure you are getting many "Its not in Focus"  I will not pick on that directly here.  One question I have is as follows.  Is the spiral peice of metal in the same plane or does it have depth?  Either way I think there are several applications that could be applied. Thank you for your time.   John (TurboTech)', '2003-08-19 01:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(392437, 33978, 4805, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Not sure if you wanted the flaring effect from the hotspots, but metering on the brightest spots would probably have eliminated some of that. I personally find that it takes away from the real flames, but others (and you) may well like it more than not. One of the standouts this challenge, for sure. Good luck.</td>', 'Very nice. Not sure if you wanted the flaring effect from the hotspots, but metering on the brightest spots would probably have eliminated some of that. I personally find that it takes away from the real flames, but others (and you) may well like it more than not. One of the standouts this challenge, for sure. Good luck.', '2003-08-19 01:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(392441, 33842, 4805, '<td valign="top">Great...love the title and the composition. The flow of the grass leads you right to the sheep. Great sharpness and colour. This will likely medal in my humble little opinion. Good luck. 10 from me...</td>', 'Great...love the title and the composition. The flow of the grass leads you right to the sheep. Great sharpness and colour. This will likely medal in my humble little opinion. Good luck. 10 from me...', '2003-08-19 01:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(392444, 33548, 4805, '<td valign="top">Something about the birds in this photo really distracts me. Perhaps it''s the expectation of negative space, but the ones on the left seem caught on the edge and throw the composition out. Lovely otherwise.</td>', 'Something about the birds in this photo really distracts me. Perhaps it''s the expectation of negative space, but the ones on the left seem caught on the edge and throw the composition out. Lovely otherwise.', '2003-08-19 02:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(392447, 33814, 4805, '<td valign="top">Very nice! The pose is unusual for a child of that age. Good eye to get it.</td>', 'Very nice! The pose is unusual for a child of that age. Good eye to get it.', '2003-08-19 02:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(392448, 33049, 4805, '<td valign="top">Really nice. This will do very well I think. I''ve always liked infrared, must try it with my camera. This will do it very well. 10 from me...</td>', 'Really nice. This will do very well I think. I''ve always liked infrared, must try it with my camera. This will do it very well. 10 from me...', '2003-08-19 02:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(392451, 33370, 4805, '<td valign="top">Oooh, like this idea. I really, really like the toning and shading on the coffee cup - so much in fact that I''d have seriously considered cropping just below the light. If cloning were allowed, I''d just nuke the light and keep the framing the way it is.  As such, minimizing the chromatic aberration on the light by desaturating the blue and magenta channels would have been something I''d have considered. Still, excellent.</td>', 'Oooh, like this idea. I really, really like the toning and shading on the coffee cup - so much in fact that I''d have seriously considered cropping just below the light. If cloning were allowed, I''d just nuke the light and keep the framing the way it is.  As such, minimizing the chromatic aberration on the light by desaturating the blue and magenta channels would have been something I''d have considered. Still, excellent.', '2003-08-19 02:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(392456, 34000, 4805, '<td valign="top">Just excellent. It really conveys the height, thus all the space is really justified and adds to the composition. A really pro-quality sports shot. 10. I hope this does well...</td>', 'Just excellent. It really conveys the height, thus all the space is really justified and adds to the composition. A really pro-quality sports shot. 10. I hope this does well...', '2003-08-19 02:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(392458, 33587, 4805, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. Finding beauty in purely utilitarian design is a good thing.</td>', 'I really like this one. Finding beauty in purely utilitarian design is a good thing.', '2003-08-19 02:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(392460, 33629, 4805, '<td valign="top">Awesome. Worthy of a ribbon. The only nitpick is that the white balance seems a bit off, but minor. 10.</td>', 'Awesome. Worthy of a ribbon. The only nitpick is that the white balance seems a bit off, but minor. 10.', '2003-08-19 02:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(392461, 34010, 4805, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The border really pops the birds.</td>', 'Very nice. The border really pops the birds.', '2003-08-19 02:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(392462, 34026, 4805, '<td valign="top">Love it! I think this is my favourite of the challenge. Just a beautiful range of greens and blues. If I could add one thing, it''s that you might have tried experimenting with desaturating the red in the skin tone, for it seems a bit purple and warm for the tone of the shot. Very nice nonetheless. 10.</td>', 'Love it! I think this is my favourite of the challenge. Just a beautiful range of greens and blues. If I could add one thing, it''s that you might have tried experimenting with desaturating the red in the skin tone, for it seems a bit purple and warm for the tone of the shot. Very nice nonetheless. 10.', '2003-08-19 02:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(392463, 33583, 4805, '<td valign="top">Very sharp, love the colours.</td>', 'Very sharp, love the colours.', '2003-08-19 02:20:03.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(392466, 34014, 4805, '<td valign="top">Good idea! I''d perhaps have pulled the teevee over to the left to let the cord draw us over to it, and I also might have adjusted the white balance a bit (a little grey) but it''s a cool idea. Wall''s a little dirty for it, too, but somehow suits the low-budge nature of the shot.</td>', 'Good idea! I''d perhaps have pulled the teevee over to the left to let the cord draw us over to it, and I also might have adjusted the white balance a bit (a little grey) but it''s a cool idea. Wall''s a little dirty for it, too, but somehow suits the low-budge nature of the shot.', '2003-08-19 02:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(392467, 33013, 4805, '<td valign="top">Nice! Classic composition. Really like the black and white. Excellent border.</td>', 'Nice! Classic composition. Really like the black and white. Excellent border.', '2003-08-19 02:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(392468, 33315, 4805, '<td valign="top">Great light! Very sharp. Gives the impression of the glow of a movie screen. I really like the tonal range in the popcorn. Only nitpick is the (very slight) falloff in the top left corner. I''d have considered cropping that...</td>', 'Great light! Very sharp. Gives the impression of the glow of a movie screen. I really like the tonal range in the popcorn. Only nitpick is the (very slight) falloff in the top left corner. I''d have considered cropping that...', '2003-08-19 02:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(392469, 34016, 4805, '<td valign="top">A very beautiful shot...not really what I would have considered negative space, but deserving of a very high score anyways.</td>', 'A very beautiful shot...not really what I would have considered negative space, but deserving of a very high score anyways.', '2003-08-19 02:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(392471, 33304, 4805, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Great composition. Personally (might be just me) I might have tried balancing the negative space around the hands equally above, below and to the right (cropping a bit off the right). Still, just beautiful the way it is. Good luck!</td>', 'Excellent. Great composition. Personally (might be just me) I might have tried balancing the negative space around the hands equally above, below and to the right (cropping a bit off the right). Still, just beautiful the way it is. Good luck!', '2003-08-19 02:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(392472, 33075, 4805, '<td valign="top">Great idea! did you think to try placing the pin on the left instead of the right? I may have tried that to give it a little balance. Nevertheless, a great shot.</td>', 'Great idea! did you think to try placing the pin on the left instead of the right? I may have tried that to give it a little balance. Nevertheless, a great shot.', '2003-08-19 02:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(392476, 33448, 4805, '<td valign="top">Awesome...very lucky with the light here, excellent eye! A minor nitpick...the branch at left really leads my eye away. I''d personally have cropped it. Still, just excellent.</td>', 'Awesome...very lucky with the light here, excellent eye! A minor nitpick...the branch at left really leads my eye away. I''d personally have cropped it. Still, just excellent.', '2003-08-19 02:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(392484, 34025, 10414, '<td valign="top">Very clever idea!!!   Great shot! 9</td>', 'Very clever idea!!!   Great shot! 9', '2003-08-19 02:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(392486, 33548, 10414, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors!  The rippling in the water makes for a great picture!</td>', 'Beautiful colors!  The rippling in the water makes for a great picture!', '2003-08-19 02:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(392489, 34022, 10414, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture!!!!!!     10</td>', 'Wonderful picture!!!!!!     10', '2003-08-19 02:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(392497, 33310, 2058, '<td valign="top">wow.................</td>', 'wow.................', '2003-08-19 02:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(392501, 33431, 10414, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture...and beautiful model!  Very tastefully done!  Great job!   9</td>', 'Beautiful picture...and beautiful model!  Very tastefully done!  Great job!   9', '2003-08-19 02:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(392504, 34019, 2058, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic... I think a bit more light on the table to make it stick out would have helped though</td>', 'Very dramatic... I think a bit more light on the table to make it stick out would have helped though', '2003-08-19 03:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(392518, 33861, 6349, '<td valign="top">10.  The focus on this is awesome as are the blue tones.  The negative space is dynamic and conveys the plane''s motion while at the same time being well balanced and rather new age artsy in it''s simple gradients.  Great capture.</td>', '10.  The focus on this is awesome as are the blue tones.  The negative space is dynamic and conveys the plane''s motion while at the same time being well balanced and rather new age artsy in it''s simple gradients.  Great capture.', '2003-08-19 03:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(392520, 34000, 6349, '<td valign="top">10.  Yes!  Wow!  Negative space very very well used here.  Spectacular shot, what more can I say? !</td>', '10.  Yes!  Wow!  Negative space very very well used here.  Spectacular shot, what more can I say? !', '2003-08-19 03:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(392521, 33583, 6349, '<td valign="top">10.   The DOF is simply perfect.  It really helps add to the feeling of the misty negative space.  The colors and composition are excellent.  I wouldn''t change a thing about this.  I think it would do very well as a print.</td>', '10.   The DOF is simply perfect.  It really helps add to the feeling of the misty negative space.  The colors and composition are excellent.  I wouldn''t change a thing about this.  I think it would do very well as a print.', '2003-08-19 03:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(392522, 33629, 6349, '<td valign="top">10.  I love this little guy.  The antennas make this image what it is and also aid in making the negative space more interesting.  I hope others can appreciate the negative space in this shot as well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', '10.  I love this little guy.  The antennas make this image what it is and also aid in making the negative space more interesting.  I hope others can appreciate the negative space in this shot as well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-08-19 03:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(392523, 33373, 11172, '<td valign="top">Great shot for "wowing" your photo!</td>', 'Great shot for "wowing" your photo!', '2003-08-19 03:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(392524, 33149, 6349, '<td valign="top">10.  I absolutely love this shot but I don''t see it doing all that well in the challenge, but I hope I''m wrong.  The simplicity is perfect.  The lines tones and shadows are a gentle mix of pattern and chaos.  An urban jungle.  Oh, it could represent or be so many things.  It is art and belongs in a gallery selling for a ridiculous price.</td>', '10.  I absolutely love this shot but I don''t see it doing all that well in the challenge, but I hope I''m wrong.  The simplicity is perfect.  The lines tones and shadows are a gentle mix of pattern and chaos.  An urban jungle.  Oh, it could represent or be so many things.  It is art and belongs in a gallery selling for a ridiculous price.', '2003-08-19 03:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(392525, 33568, 6349, '<td valign="top">9.  This is a great shot.  The exposure and DOF are just right.  The wings look like paper!  The only reason I''m giving this a 9 and not a 10 is that I don''t really get the feeling that it was taken FOR the challenge.  The negative space is definetely not really what comes to mind as the power of the shot, it''s simply a well blurred background as created with the proper aperature.  Still, I can see why you submitted it, the negative space is pretty interesting and I wouldn''t have been able to not submit such an amazing shot either!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', '9.  This is a great shot.  The exposure and DOF are just right.  The wings look like paper!  The only reason I''m giving this a 9 and not a 10 is that I don''t really get the feeling that it was taken FOR the challenge.  The negative space is definetely not really what comes to mind as the power of the shot, it''s simply a well blurred background as created with the proper aperature.  Still, I can see why you submitted it, the negative space is pretty interesting and I wouldn''t have been able to not submit such an amazing shot either!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-08-19 03:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(392526, 34016, 6349, '<td valign="top">9.  The more I think about this photo I think it doesn''t really have negative space at all IMO, but I still can''t help but give it at least a 9.  It would be a 10 if the colors were more vibrant.  It''s a shame for an image like this to be as dull as it is.  You could really make it pop with some post processing.  The composition and capture are simply beautiful.  Great work!</td>', '9.  The more I think about this photo I think it doesn''t really have negative space at all IMO, but I still can''t help but give it at least a 9.  It would be a 10 if the colors were more vibrant.  It''s a shame for an image like this to be as dull as it is.  You could really make it pop with some post processing.  The composition and capture are simply beautiful.  Great work!', '2003-08-19 03:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(392527, 33252, 6349, '<td valign="top">9.  This is just such a great macro that I had to give it a 9 even though I don''t think it''s the best example of fitting the topic or creativity.  The pollen, oh the pollen, that''s what did it for me, as well as the incredibly accurate DOF.  Great capture.</td>', '9.  This is just such a great macro that I had to give it a 9 even though I don''t think it''s the best example of fitting the topic or creativity.  The pollen, oh the pollen, that''s what did it for me, as well as the incredibly accurate DOF.  Great capture.', '2003-08-19 03:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(392528, 34026, 6349, '<td valign="top">10.  The textures and colors in this are beautiful.  The pose with the feet on the wall is perfect although I''m not that fond of the one arm up and one arm down.  I would have preferred both one way or the other, but that''s being picky I know :)  I hope her name is hope and I hope this does well!  Great job.  This is art.</td>', '10.  The textures and colors in this are beautiful.  The pose with the feet on the wall is perfect although I''m not that fond of the one arm up and one arm down.  I would have preferred both one way or the other, but that''s being picky I know :)  I hope her name is hope and I hope this does well!  Great job.  This is art.', '2003-08-19 03:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(392529, 34020, 6349, '<td valign="top">9.  This shot is very well executed.  I can see this as the most marketable of all the entries.  Of course it is therefore lacking on the creative side, but that''s the price you pay for fame and money!  Seriously though, this is beatifully composed.  The time you put into the lighting is very evident and well done.  Definetely make this a print if possible.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', '9.  This shot is very well executed.  I can see this as the most marketable of all the entries.  Of course it is therefore lacking on the creative side, but that''s the price you pay for fame and money!  Seriously though, this is beatifully composed.  The time you put into the lighting is very evident and well done.  Definetely make this a print if possible.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-08-19 03:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(392531, 33370, 6349, '<td valign="top">9.  Subtle.  Elegant.  Printable.  Marketable.  Excellent job.  Interesting negative space.</td>', '9.  Subtle.  Elegant.  Printable.  Marketable.  Excellent job.  Interesting negative space.', '2003-08-19 03:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(392532, 33727, 6349, '<td valign="top">9.  I kept bumping the score up on this one as I didn''t like it at first glance.  It grew on me and I noticed more and more technical merits.  I think this will do very well in the challenge and despite the fact that something about it just doesn''t appeal to me (perhaps the diagonal sland and unbalanced composition, but I''m not really sure if that''s it), I hate to be the one to not acknowlege excellent work.  Make a print of this, people will buy it.</td>', '9.  I kept bumping the score up on this one as I didn''t like it at first glance.  It grew on me and I noticed more and more technical merits.  I think this will do very well in the challenge and despite the fact that something about it just doesn''t appeal to me (perhaps the diagonal sland and unbalanced composition, but I''m not really sure if that''s it), I hate to be the one to not acknowlege excellent work.  Make a print of this, people will buy it.', '2003-08-19 03:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(392533, 33889, 6349, '<td valign="top">9.  This is my favorite "negative space" in the challenge.  It really gives power to the shot.  Excellent work.</td>', '9.  This is my favorite "negative space" in the challenge.  It really gives power to the shot.  Excellent work.', '2003-08-19 04:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(392549, 33629, 5728, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites this week, awesome shot! (10)</td>', 'One of my favourites this week, awesome shot! (10)', '2003-08-19 05:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(392556, 33100, 6199, '<td valign="top">I would have wanted to see more modern style building to create more distinguishing negative space around the old building. Otherwise good.</td>', 'I would have wanted to see more modern style building to create more distinguishing negative space around the old building. Otherwise good.', '2003-08-19 06:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(392561, 33315, 6059, '<td valign="top">great shallow dept of field...<br/> <br/>it is a neg. space, for sure... - I like your creativity...<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge, v.</td>', 'great shallow dept of field... it is a neg. space, for sure... - I like your creativity... Good luck in the challenge, v.', '2003-08-19 06:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
