(392605, 33370, 10883, '<td valign="top">Good picture, the coffee cup comes out nicely and the table also, but i think the light is not defined enough, it just washes into one white blob. - 7</td>', 'Good picture, the coffee cup comes out nicely and the table also, but i think the light is not defined enough, it just washes into one white blob. - 7', '2003-08-19 09:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
