(392608, 33822, 8522, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept, unfortunately your lighting REALLY doesn''t flatter the subject. The harsh shadows really detract, and the glare on the eyes is a big minus. 5</td>', 'Excellent concept, unfortunately your lighting REALLY doesn''t flatter the subject. The harsh shadows really detract, and the glare on the eyes is a big minus. 5', '2003-08-19 09:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
