(392610, 33893, 10883, '<td valign="top">What weird glow is that around the branch?  I do not like the frame.<br/>I´m sorry but that glow looks too weird for my, looks photoshopped.  Hope I´m wrong though.</td>', 'What weird glow is that around the branch?  I do not like the frame.I´m sorry but that glow looks too weird for my, looks photoshopped.  Hope I´m wrong though.', '2003-08-19 09:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(392613, 33929, 8522, '<td valign="top">Took me a little while to get my bearings here! Nice idea, but I don''t like the glare at the bottom right of the frame, and there are too many reflections in the paint for this to really work as negative space for me. 5</td>', 'Took me a little while to get my bearings here! Nice idea, but I don''t like the glare at the bottom right of the frame, and there are too many reflections in the paint for this to really work as negative space for me. 5', '2003-08-19 09:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
