(392626, 33252, 8522, '<td valign="top">Incredible macro, but the wow of this photo doesn''t come from the negative space I''m afraid! Score: 6 although I''ll be sure to put this in my favourites after the challenge. Nice composition. Great colours.</td>', 'Incredible macro, but the wow of this photo doesn''t come from the negative space I''m afraid! Score: 6 although I''ll be sure to put this in my favourites after the challenge. Nice composition. Great colours.', '2003-08-19 09:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(392630, 33047, 8522, '<td valign="top">I wish I could score this higher, as I love it, but to me the coloured background has too much texture to count as negative space. Score: 5, but well done on a great picture.</td>', 'I wish I could score this higher, as I love it, but to me the coloured background has too much texture to count as negative space. Score: 5, but well done on a great picture.', '2003-08-19 09:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(392634, 33629, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great character shot, nicely lit, great background. I love the head-on composition. 10</td>', 'Great character shot, nicely lit, great background. I love the head-on composition. 10', '2003-08-19 09:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(392635, 34000, 8522, '<td valign="top">Brilliant! Very effective use of negative space. Very sharp, nicely saturated. Great capture. 10</td>', 'Brilliant! Very effective use of negative space. Very sharp, nicely saturated. Great capture. 10', '2003-08-19 10:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(392636, 33544, 10773, '<td valign="top">Great shot ...love the composition and humor!</td>', 'Great shot ...love the composition and humor!', '2003-08-19 10:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(392637, 33502, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, very sharp, great textures. 2 things bother me though... the shadows behind him spoil it a little for me, and the background has too much textural detail for me to really see it as negative space. However, score: 9</td>', 'Lovely shot, very sharp, great textures. 2 things bother me though... the shadows behind him spoil it a little for me, and the background has too much textural detail for me to really see it as negative space. However, score: 9', '2003-08-19 10:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(392639, 34026, 8522, '<td valign="top">I REALLY love this shot, the feet are a nice touch which temporarily disorient the viewer. Wonderful saturation and lighting. However, to really meet the challenge I think there''s too much interest in your negative space. 9</td>', 'I REALLY love this shot, the feet are a nice touch which temporarily disorient the viewer. Wonderful saturation and lighting. However, to really meet the challenge I think there''s too much interest in your negative space. 9', '2003-08-19 10:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(392646, 33304, 10768, '<td valign="top">Very Dramatic photo.  Negative space definitely adds to the feel of this image.  Wonderful. - 9</td>', 'Very Dramatic photo.  Negative space definitely adds to the feel of this image.  Wonderful. - 9', '2003-08-19 10:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(392648, 33733, 10768, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Very effective depiction of negative space.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Very effective depiction of negative space.  Nice composition.', '2003-08-19 10:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(392650, 33448, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Top 3 for sure.  What a capture.  Right place at the righ time?  excellent tones and composition.   Good luck.  Jacko.  10</td>', 'Wow.  Top 3 for sure.  What a capture.  Right place at the righ time?  excellent tones and composition.   Good luck.  Jacko.  10', '2003-08-19 10:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(392653, 33442, 10768, '<td valign="top">The flower bud has a nice, sharp image.  Very effective use of negative space.   The black background really brings out the colors of this flower.   Well done!</td>', 'The flower bud has a nice, sharp image.  Very effective use of negative space.   The black background really brings out the colors of this flower.   Well done!', '2003-08-19 10:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(392673, 33583, 8522, '<td valign="top">Absolutely superb... by far and away my favourite shot this challenge. The colours couldn''t be more perfect. The graduated background is lovely. Exposure is spot-on. Great sharpness and clarity, very effective dof. Great composition. I just can''t fault this in any way. Hope this wins a ribbon. 10</td>', 'Absolutely superb... by far and away my favourite shot this challenge. The colours couldn''t be more perfect. The graduated background is lovely. Exposure is spot-on. Great sharpness and clarity, very effective dof. Great composition. I just can''t fault this in any way. Hope this wins a ribbon. 10', '2003-08-19 11:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(392675, 34029, 9295, '<td valign="top">Not being able to vote, I almost didn''t take the time to leave a comment on this, but I have to tell you, this is one of my favorites of the challenge.  The only things I don''t care for is the little white thing in the lower left by the treeline (looks like a water tower or something) and the white spec to the right of the mountain (looks like a plane maybe).  I''m sure you had no choice but to have them in the shot, but the peak itself is so beautiful and natural, it''s a shame to have seemingly man-made items touch the scene. Despite that, if I could vote, I would give you a 10. I absolutely love this.</td>', 'Not being able to vote, I almost didn''t take the time to leave a comment on this, but I have to tell you, this is one of my favorites of the challenge.  The only things I don''t care for is the little white thing in the lower left by the treeline (looks like a water tower or something) and the white spec to the right of the mountain (looks like a plane maybe).  I''m sure you had no choice but to have them in the shot, but the peak itself is so beautiful and natural, it''s a shame to have seemingly man-made items touch the scene. Despite that, if I could vote, I would give you a 10. I absolutely love this.', '2003-08-19 11:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(392681, 33310, 9295, '<td valign="top">I need to view this on a different monitor I reckon, cuz I can''t see a darned thing. It certainly is negative space though.  :-)</td>', 'I need to view this on a different monitor I reckon, cuz I can''t see a darned thing. It certainly is negative space though.  :-)', '2003-08-19 11:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(392688, 34012, 9295, '<td valign="top">Although interesting, in my opinion, for this to work as you intend, both sides must be perfectly symmetrical.  You are a little off (the right silhouette is a little higher than the left and you can see just a hint of light on the lips on that face as well) so you are losing some of what you are going for. Not terribly, but enough to deter from the illusion. I have no doubt though that it was difficult enough to get it this close.  I applaud the attempt.</td>', 'Although interesting, in my opinion, for this to work as you intend, both sides must be perfectly symmetrical.  You are a little off (the right silhouette is a little higher than the left and you can see just a hint of light on the lips on that face as well) so you are losing some of what you are going for. Not terribly, but enough to deter from the illusion. I have no doubt though that it was difficult enough to get it this close.  I applaud the attempt.', '2003-08-19 11:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(392690, 33218, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is great!  I love the blueness of the water and the expression on his face is perfectly captured.  Just a terrific shot!</td>', 'This is great!  I love the blueness of the water and the expression on his face is perfectly captured.  Just a terrific shot!', '2003-08-19 11:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(392706, 33442, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours, effective composition. Nice deep black -ve space. Great saturation and sharpness. Lighting just a little on the harsh side. 9</td>', 'Beautiful colours, effective composition. Nice deep black -ve space. Great saturation and sharpness. Lighting just a little on the harsh side. 9', '2003-08-19 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(392707, 34004, 8522, '<td valign="top">Simple and sweet. Nice, subtle saturation. Effective graduated background. Good lighting, but could have done without the shadows in the centre of the flower. 8</td>', 'Simple and sweet. Nice, subtle saturation. Effective graduated background. Good lighting, but could have done without the shadows in the centre of the flower. 8', '2003-08-19 12:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(392709, 33872, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very effective juxtaposition of red and white. The white writing mirrors your -ve space. The rope adds compositional interest. Impressive how you got the white background so smooth and free of texture. 8</td>', 'Very effective juxtaposition of red and white. The white writing mirrors your -ve space. The rope adds compositional interest. Impressive how you got the white background so smooth and free of texture. 8', '2003-08-19 12:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(392711, 33310, 5491, '<td valign="top">haha</td>', 'haha', '2003-08-19 12:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(392712, 34014, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great concept. Shame about the distortion caused by your wide-angle lens, but as we''re not allowed to apply correction in Photoshop, I''ll ignore it. A bit less glare on the TV would have helped. The dirty white wall behind the telly is an effective touch. 8</td>', 'Great concept. Shame about the distortion caused by your wide-angle lens, but as we''re not allowed to apply correction in Photoshop, I''ll ignore it. A bit less glare on the TV would have helped. The dirty white wall behind the telly is an effective touch. 8', '2003-08-19 12:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(392715, 34015, 8522, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, the texture of the wood is really enhanced by the use of -ve space here. Effective composition, you''ve got a great eye! I''m impressed by how much contrast there is here between the light and shadow. 8</td>', 'I love this shot, the texture of the wood is really enhanced by the use of -ve space here. Effective composition, you''ve got a great eye! I''m impressed by how much contrast there is here between the light and shadow. 8', '2003-08-19 12:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(392719, 33777, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''m not exactly sure what function the neg space accomplishes here, but I like it and it does give the feeling that there is more to HomeGrocer.com than meets the eye. I think you''ve achieved perfect balance here. This would make a good ad for HomeGrocer.com.</td>', 'I''m not exactly sure what function the neg space accomplishes here, but I like it and it does give the feeling that there is more to HomeGrocer.com than meets the eye. I think you''ve achieved perfect balance here. This would make a good ad for HomeGrocer.com.', '2003-08-19 12:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(392721, 33729, 6870, '<td valign="top">The neg space of black contrasts well with the lighting. I think you''ve achieved a nice exposure here--not too bright that the colors and details are washed, not too dark either.</td>', 'The neg space of black contrasts well with the lighting. I think you''ve achieved a nice exposure here--not too bright that the colors and details are washed, not too dark either.', '2003-08-19 12:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(392724, 34016, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun perspective here! I like the baloon as neg space, though I wish the basket actually got most of the attn because of it. Currently for me the central inner circle of bright colors steals the show. Really fun shot.</td>', 'Fun perspective here! I like the baloon as neg space, though I wish the basket actually got most of the attn because of it. Currently for me the central inner circle of bright colors steals the show. Really fun shot.', '2003-08-19 12:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(392726, 33820, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like! the neg space makes your light-line-shape thingy seem more mysterious and interesting. 9</td>', 'I like! the neg space makes your light-line-shape thingy seem more mysterious and interesting. 9', '2003-08-19 12:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(392727, 33442, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super lighting. The neg space here add balance and mystery. Well done.</td>', 'Super lighting. The neg space here add balance and mystery. Well done.', '2003-08-19 12:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(392729, 33814, 6870, '<td valign="top">Soft focus works well to add mood here. Sillhouette certainly gains attn because of the neg. space.</td>', 'Soft focus works well to add mood here. Sillhouette certainly gains attn because of the neg. space.', '2003-08-19 12:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(392731, 33892, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I like the bright spots on the shoed and am glad they are well placed (both the shoes and the bright spots). neg space here adds a sense that the shoes are more than they seem. My first thought was Wizard of Oz.</td>', 'Nice composition. I like the bright spots on the shoed and am glad they are well placed (both the shoes and the bright spots). neg space here adds a sense that the shoes are more than they seem. My first thought was Wizard of Oz.', '2003-08-19 12:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(392732, 33450, 6870, '<td valign="top">Yummy, a mushroom! Unless it''s poisonous.... Nice work. Not a lot of neg space, so your the challenge is met subtely here, but there is enough for my tastes. (Pun intended)</td>', 'Yummy, a mushroom! Unless it''s poisonous.... Nice work. Not a lot of neg space, so your the challenge is met subtely here, but there is enough for my tastes. (Pun intended)', '2003-08-19 12:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(392734, 33100, 6870, '<td valign="top">Amazing lighting. this is just super work. How you''ve managed to get this building dark while all around is lighter is amazing. Clarity and communication of this shot are perfect. Super work. 10</td>', 'Amazing lighting. this is just super work. How you''ve managed to get this building dark while all around is lighter is amazing. Clarity and communication of this shot are perfect. Super work. 10', '2003-08-19 12:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(392736, 33311, 6870, '<td valign="top">Leaf is a little bright--it steals some focus from your lovely butterfly, which shows some very nice detail. I love the darker background--it sets off the insect admirably!</td>', 'Leaf is a little bright--it steals some focus from your lovely butterfly, which shows some very nice detail. I love the darker background--it sets off the insect admirably!', '2003-08-19 12:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(392737, 33417, 8522, '<td valign="top">An amusing shot, effectively captured. Well done for making your nackground so uniformly black. Great lighting. I''d say that the ''wow'' factor here is definitely in the -ve space. 8</td>', 'An amusing shot, effectively captured. Well done for making your nackground so uniformly black. Great lighting. I''d say that the ''wow'' factor here is definitely in the -ve space. 8', '2003-08-19 12:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(392738, 33865, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lots of neg space here! I like the radicalness of this shot. Somehow the poles keep my interest--though I have no idea why!</td>', 'Lots of neg space here! I like the radicalness of this shot. Somehow the poles keep my interest--though I have no idea why!', '2003-08-19 12:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(392739, 33587, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I love the light and shadow here. Shame about the wide-angle distortion, I wish we could correct it in Photoshop. Effective exposure, great composition. 8</td>', 'Great shot, I love the light and shadow here. Shame about the wide-angle distortion, I wish we could correct it in Photoshop. Effective exposure, great composition. 8', '2003-08-19 12:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(392742, 33408, 6870, '<td valign="top">The face here is very dark, which is an interesting choice as it makes this subject appear like an Everyman type of figure. However, the detail that IS there is very interesting, and I find myself craving more. Perhaps either darker or lighter would work? It might be fun to experiment. Very nice composition here; the neg space invites my thoughts to extend to the world around this subject.</td>', 'The face here is very dark, which is an interesting choice as it makes this subject appear like an Everyman type of figure. However, the detail that IS there is very interesting, and I find myself craving more. Perhaps either darker or lighter would work? It might be fun to experiment. Very nice composition here; the neg space invites my thoughts to extend to the world around this subject.', '2003-08-19 12:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(392743, 33251, 8522, '<td valign="top">I gave this one a lot of contemplation, I don''t think this is a shot that can be appreciated in 5 seconds. It definitely leaves me wanting to know what it is, the viewer has to use their imagination to make the best of it. I like to see it as a porthole into space... Superb textures and composition, great use of light and shadow. Very good clarity. 8</td>', 'I gave this one a lot of contemplation, I don''t think this is a shot that can be appreciated in 5 seconds. It definitely leaves me wanting to know what it is, the viewer has to use their imagination to make the best of it. I like to see it as a porthole into space... Superb textures and composition, great use of light and shadow. Very good clarity. 8', '2003-08-19 12:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(392744, 33889, 10768, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.  The lines really lead the viewer to the lamp post.  Nice photo.</td>', 'Interesting composition.  The lines really lead the viewer to the lamp post.  Nice photo.', '2003-08-19 12:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(392749, 33955, 9504, '<td valign="top">This is wild.  I can''t quite figure out where you were -- but very cool!</td>', 'This is wild.  I can''t quite figure out where you were -- but very cool!', '2003-08-19 12:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(392754, 34000, 7350, '<td valign="top">Perfect 10 from me.  This is fantastic.  I love how you left all the space below the subject - really shows the height well.  Good job!</td>', 'Perfect 10 from me.  This is fantastic.  I love how you left all the space below the subject - really shows the height well.  Good job!', '2003-08-19 12:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(392759, 33821, 11155, '<td valign="top">I like the xposure of the clouds.  My eye is drawn to them first, then to the boat, so I guess that counts as negative space, huh?  (seems like there''s a lot of discussion regarding what is or isn''t neg space)<br/> <br/>Nice image, good luck.</td>', 'I like the xposure of the clouds.  My eye is drawn to them first, then to the boat, so I guess that counts as negative space, huh?  (seems like there''s a lot of discussion regarding what is or isn''t neg space) Nice image, good luck.', '2003-08-19 13:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(392761, 33138, 11155, '<td valign="top">I really like the angle of the photo - that''s pretty original.  I would have liked to have seen a more prominent background, though (exotic colors in the sky, reflections, or something)  Good luck in the contest.</td>', 'I really like the angle of the photo - that''s pretty original.  I would have liked to have seen a more prominent background, though (exotic colors in the sky, reflections, or something)  Good luck in the contest.', '2003-08-19 13:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(392762, 34015, 11155, '<td valign="top">Now see, this I like.  The subject is the light through the window.  But it wouldn''t be visible without the darkness surrounding it.  The wood in the light has nice detail.  Good luck in the contest.</td>', 'Now see, this I like.  The subject is the light through the window.  But it wouldn''t be visible without the darkness surrounding it.  The wood in the light has nice detail.  Good luck in the contest.', '2003-08-19 13:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(392763, 33544, 11155, '<td valign="top">For this contest, I am understanding that negative space = the area surrounding the subject.  In this image, that would be the sky, which just isn''t interesting to me.  The kite is cool, but that''s the subject of the image - and there''s nothing else that is interesting to look at.  Maybe if there was an orange/pink sunset sky or something, I would like this better.  Good luck in the contest.</td>', 'For this contest, I am understanding that negative space = the area surrounding the subject.  In this image, that would be the sky, which just isn''t interesting to me.  The kite is cool, but that''s the subject of the image - and there''s nothing else that is interesting to look at.  Maybe if there was an orange/pink sunset sky or something, I would like this better.  Good luck in the contest.', '2003-08-19 13:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(392764, 33345, 11155, '<td valign="top">For this contest, I am understanding that negative space = the area surrounding the subject.  In this image, that would be the sky, which just isn''t interesting to me.  The statue is cool, but that''s the subject of the image - and there''s nothing else that is interesting to look at.  Maybe if there was an orange/pink sunset sky or something, I would like this better.  Good luck in the contest.</td>', 'For this contest, I am understanding that negative space = the area surrounding the subject.  In this image, that would be the sky, which just isn''t interesting to me.  The statue is cool, but that''s the subject of the image - and there''s nothing else that is interesting to look at.  Maybe if there was an orange/pink sunset sky or something, I would like this better.  Good luck in the contest.', '2003-08-19 13:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(392768, 33629, 7350, '<td valign="top">Nice of you to give him so much room to jump.  9.</td>', 'Nice of you to give him so much room to jump.  9.', '2003-08-19 13:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(392771, 33370, 8522, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective. Good use of -ve space, your lighting works well here. 8</td>', 'Simple and effective. Good use of -ve space, your lighting works well here. 8', '2003-08-19 13:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(392772, 33844, 8522, '<td valign="top">I like the use of soft-focus here, but it does result in just a little too much loss of detail in her hair. I wish you could have got the background to appear darker, there''s also too much noise in the top-left. Nice lighting. 7</td>', 'I like the use of soft-focus here, but it does result in just a little too much loss of detail in her hair. I wish you could have got the background to appear darker, there''s also too much noise in the top-left. Nice lighting. 7', '2003-08-19 13:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
