(393247, 33785, 11184, '<td valign="top">How can you just sit there and not try to help him like that before he falls?  Typical tabloid journalism.      Sure looks perty though.   (that blurry flower at the top right above him is a little distracting though...and the dark thing to the right of it...maybe try cropping them out?)</td>', 'How can you just sit there and not try to help him like that before he falls?  Typical tabloid journalism.      Sure looks perty though.   (that blurry flower at the top right above him is a little distracting though...and the dark thing to the right of it...maybe try cropping them out?)', '2003-08-19 22:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
