(393274, 33760, 2716, '<td valign="top">Super vantage point.  Dunno how you did it, but it''s great.   I really like the diagonal lines.  Makes for a very dynamic shot.  Good luck.  Jacko.  10</td>', 'Super vantage point.  Dunno how you did it, but it''s great.   I really like the diagonal lines.  Makes for a very dynamic shot.  Good luck.  Jacko.  10', '2003-08-19 23:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
