(393276, 34012, 6870, '<td valign="top">I remember this optical illusion! This is a fun revisit of it, and the negative space really enhances the feel of the photo. The darkness on the face is nice, and I like that I can still see some detail if I look. I can''t help but think that the white background could be some cool color, though.  This must have been one tricky shot! Very nice. 9</td>', 'I remember this optical illusion! This is a fun revisit of it, and the negative space really enhances the feel of the photo. The darkness on the face is nice, and I like that I can still see some detail if I look. I can''t help but think that the white background could be some cool color, though.  This must have been one tricky shot! Very nice. 9', '2003-08-19 23:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(393277, 33502, 2716, '<td valign="top">What a cute portrait.  I really like it.  The soccer ball really adds a point of interest.  Great shot.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'What a cute portrait.  I really like it.  The soccer ball really adds a point of interest.  Great shot.  Jacko.  9', '2003-08-19 23:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(393278, 34028, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love the tones here; very comfortable and inviting. Neg space seems to add mystery to the shot, and communicates that there is more to this world than just the bells. 9</td>', 'I love the tones here; very comfortable and inviting. Neg space seems to add mystery to the shot, and communicates that there is more to this world than just the bells. 9', '2003-08-19 23:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(393279, 33417, 2716, '<td valign="top">lol.  That is so funny.  Very creative.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'lol.  That is so funny.  Very creative.  Jacko.  8', '2003-08-19 23:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
