(394928, 34000, 7339, '<td valign="top">Great job. I really like the height, you show it here perfectly. Everything is in focus and the lights good to. I gave it a 7</td>', 'Great job. I really like the height, you show it here perfectly. Everything is in focus and the lights good to. I gave it a 7', '2003-08-20 19:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(394929, 33978, 7339, '<td valign="top">Nice job. I love fire and this meets the challenge nicely. Very sharp flames and logs. Good job, I gave it a 7</td>', 'Nice job. I love fire and this meets the challenge nicely. Very sharp flames and logs. Good job, I gave it a 7', '2003-08-20 19:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(394931, 33013, 4411, '<td valign="top">Oh yes. Great use of DoF to create the negative space. Focus on the daisy is spot on.<br/>Would love to see the colour version after the challenge, I have a feeling that I would like it even more, but that''s down to personal taste.<br/>I think a white border would suit the shot better than the grey, but pffft what does that matter.<br/>''Only'' a 9 because it leaves me wanting to see colour.</td>', 'Oh yes. Great use of DoF to create the negative space. Focus on the daisy is spot on.Would love to see the colour version after the challenge, I have a feeling that I would like it even more, but that''s down to personal taste.I think a white border would suit the shot better than the grey, but pffft what does that matter.''Only'' a 9 because it leaves me wanting to see colour.', '2003-08-20 19:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(394933, 33548, 7339, '<td valign="top">Cool, you have double the negative space. I really like the color tone and composure of this shot. The only thing that takes a bit away are the two ducks on the left. And the only reason I think that is my attention is drawn there when the negative space should be surrounding the main focus which in my view would be the tree line. Still I love the shot and gave it an 8</td>', 'Cool, you have double the negative space. I really like the color tone and composure of this shot. The only thing that takes a bit away are the two ducks on the left. And the only reason I think that is my attention is drawn there when the negative space should be surrounding the main focus which in my view would be the tree line. Still I love the shot and gave it an 8', '2003-08-20 19:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(394935, 34031, 4411, '<td valign="top">Needs a stronger subject to offset the negative space. The colour is superb though.</td>', 'Needs a stronger subject to offset the negative space. The colour is superb though.', '2003-08-20 20:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(394936, 33861, 7339, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. This couldnt have been easy very clear, focus seems perfect. Good job, 7 from me.</td>', 'Cool shot. This couldnt have been easy very clear, focus seems perfect. Good job, 7 from me.', '2003-08-20 20:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(394940, 34023, 7339, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. Makes me want to see whats outside of the tunnel. The blue hue is cool too. I gave it a 7.</td>', 'I like this shot. Makes me want to see whats outside of the tunnel. The blue hue is cool too. I gave it a 7.', '2003-08-20 20:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(394944, 33822, 7339, '<td valign="top">Not only is this a great example of negative space but it really made me laugh which doesnt happen to often. Originally I gave it a 7 but I have since changed my mind and it gets an 8 instead. Nice job...</td>', 'Not only is this a great example of negative space but it really made me laugh which doesnt happen to often. Originally I gave it a 7 but I have since changed my mind and it gets an 8 instead. Nice job...', '2003-08-20 20:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(394948, 33234, 4411, '<td valign="top">Personally I woiuld have moved the plant to the low point of the tree line which would have provided leading lines down to the subject, and moved the subject away from the center of the frame.<br/>Otherwise this is very well done. I like silhouttes anyway, and the fog obscured trees add interest to the background.</td>', 'Personally I woiuld have moved the plant to the low point of the tree line which would have provided leading lines down to the subject, and moved the subject away from the center of the frame.Otherwise this is very well done. I like silhouttes anyway, and the fog obscured trees add interest to the background.', '2003-08-20 20:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(394973, 33047, 9462, '<td valign="top">Can''t wait to add this to my favs;)</td>', 'Can''t wait to add this to my favs;)', '2003-08-20 20:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(394991, 34001, 8637, '<td valign="top">Interesting approach...negative space in sectors.  Little dark for me...but nice capture.</td>', 'Interesting approach...negative space in sectors.  Little dark for me...but nice capture.', '2003-08-20 20:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(394992, 33741, 8637, '<td valign="top">Would like to have had the foliage a little more highlighted since that is the focus...but fits the challenge well.</td>', 'Would like to have had the foliage a little more highlighted since that is the focus...but fits the challenge well.', '2003-08-20 20:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(394993, 33456, 8637, '<td valign="top">Nice capture...seems a little soft for me but that may have been intended.</td>', 'Nice capture...seems a little soft for me but that may have been intended.', '2003-08-20 20:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(394995, 33961, 8637, '<td valign="top">Don''t think the border adds here...but nice approach to the challenge.</td>', 'Don''t think the border adds here...but nice approach to the challenge.', '2003-08-20 20:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(394998, 33224, 8637, '<td valign="top">Cool..simple, meets the challenge, and nice shot.  Would be interesting to try different color backdrops on the sky with the yellow balloon.</td>', 'Cool..simple, meets the challenge, and nice shot.  Would be interesting to try different color backdrops on the sky with the yellow balloon.', '2003-08-20 20:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(395000, 33558, 8637, '<td valign="top">Great shot...goes well with the natural appearance of the cloud color and the geese.</td>', 'Great shot...goes well with the natural appearance of the cloud color and the geese.', '2003-08-20 20:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(395001, 33628, 8637, '<td valign="top">Great capture and very nice approach to the challenge.  Lot of potential with this idea.</td>', 'Great capture and very nice approach to the challenge.  Lot of potential with this idea.', '2003-08-20 20:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(395003, 33088, 8637, '<td valign="top">I would have like it better with just the fruit...nice capture and very sharp image.</td>', 'I would have like it better with just the fruit...nice capture and very sharp image.', '2003-08-20 20:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(395005, 33450, 8637, '<td valign="top">Not sure this meets the challenge...neat idea though and excellent capture.</td>', 'Not sure this meets the challenge...neat idea though and excellent capture.', '2003-08-20 20:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(395006, 33821, 8637, '<td valign="top">Very nice and really like the presence of reflective surface ripples but no sun.</td>', 'Very nice and really like the presence of reflective surface ripples but no sun.', '2003-08-20 20:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(395007, 33923, 8637, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  What might have been really neat would be to capture a drop of moisture somehow off the wing tip...very different shot I know but fog seems to need some sign of moisture.  Ecellent shot.</td>', 'Very nice.  What might have been really neat would be to capture a drop of moisture somehow off the wing tip...very different shot I know but fog seems to need some sign of moisture.  Ecellent shot.', '2003-08-20 20:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(395009, 33873, 8637, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot but I think the border detracts.  Not enough sense of negative space.</td>', 'Really nice shot but I think the border detracts.  Not enough sense of negative space.', '2003-08-20 20:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(395010, 34012, 8637, '<td valign="top">Cool idea...could be a little better matched faces.  Great shot.</td>', 'Cool idea...could be a little better matched faces.  Great shot.', '2003-08-20 20:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(395011, 33408, 8637, '<td valign="top">Negative space really does not add to the image.</td>', 'Negative space really does not add to the image.', '2003-08-20 20:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(395012, 34003, 8637, '<td valign="top">Do not see the capture of negative space..very nice shot though.</td>', 'Do not see the capture of negative space..very nice shot though.', '2003-08-20 20:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(395013, 33948, 8637, '<td valign="top">Sunflowers are in!  Beautiful rendition.</td>', 'Sunflowers are in!  Beautiful rendition.', '2003-08-20 20:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(395015, 33423, 8637, '<td valign="top">Border detracts and not necessary...sort of gilds the rose. Great shot without it and reduces the effect of the negative space.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Border detracts and not necessary...sort of gilds the rose. Great shot without it and reduces the effect of the negative space. ', '2003-08-20 20:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
