(395205, 33370, 6325, '<td valign="top">I like the balanced light areas with the surrounding blackness. The coffee cup is a little indistinct - I think seeing it in a larger format would help, but we just have 640. I like it.</td>', 'I like the balanced light areas with the surrounding blackness. The coffee cup is a little indistinct - I think seeing it in a larger format would help, but we just have 640. I like it.', '2003-08-20 23:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
