(395256, 34024, 10414, '<td valign="top">The pictures just keep getting better and better....and this is one of the best I''ve seen. I love a picture that can take me "there".....and here I am, standing on this beach in the fog!  WONDERFUL picture!!!   :)</td>', 'The pictures just keep getting better and better....and this is one of the best I''ve seen. I love a picture that can take me "there".....and here I am, standing on this beach in the fog!  WONDERFUL picture!!!   :)', '2003-08-21 00:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(395258, 33013, 10414, '<td valign="top">I love your choice here to use B&amp;W, and the border just adds the finishing touch to an already LOVELY picture!!   Great job!!  :)</td>', 'I love your choice here to use B&W, and the border just adds the finishing touch to an already LOVELY picture!!   Great job!!  :)', '2003-08-21 00:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
