(395260, 33893, 10414, '<td valign="top">It seems to be reaching for the sky, doesn''t it??  Nice shot...and I like your choice of a transparent border...it looks very nice!!!   :)</td>', 'It seems to be reaching for the sky, doesn''t it??  Nice shot...and I like your choice of a transparent border...it looks very nice!!!   :)', '2003-08-21 00:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
