(395295, 33310, 7778, '<td valign="top">Redundant, imitative, clichee. It may remain, for some, mildly and very briefly at that,  entertaining. <br/> <br/>The ''manner'' of this photo, however, offers hope, in a deja-vue sort of way, to those of us with an appetite for change. If the photo was inverted, this would make more sense...</td>', 'Redundant, imitative, clichee. It may remain, for some, mildly and very briefly at that,  entertaining.  The ''manner'' of this photo, however, offers hope, in a deja-vue sort of way, to those of us with an appetite for change. If the photo was inverted, this would make more sense...', '2003-08-21 00:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
