(395577, 33251, 5767, '<td valign="top">The small thumbnail wasn''t very appealing, so I waited to vote on it until after I judged some others.  BUT WOW am I glad I opened this one.  The detail is excellent, the exposure and tonal range is beautiful.  Great job.</td>', 'The small thumbnail wasn''t very appealing, so I waited to vote on it until after I judged some others.  BUT WOW am I glad I opened this one.  The detail is excellent, the exposure and tonal range is beautiful.  Great job.', '2003-08-22 02:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(395580, 33315, 5767, '<td valign="top">This is a fun one.  Although this is definitely not the environment I would expect popcorn to be in (all white background) - so good idea, but the elements just don''t work together (for me as a viewer).</td>', 'This is a fun one.  Although this is definitely not the environment I would expect popcorn to be in (all white background) - so good idea, but the elements just don''t work together (for me as a viewer).', '2003-08-22 02:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(395582, 33919, 5767, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and I am wondering how you got the lightbulb suspended there?  Focus is a little soft around your? eyes (which is a key component to get in focus).  Whites are a littel too bright as well.   BUT, this is still a strong image that I enjoyed.</td>', 'Interesting idea and I am wondering how you got the lightbulb suspended there?  Focus is a little soft around your? eyes (which is a key component to get in focus).  Whites are a littel too bright as well.   BUT, this is still a strong image that I enjoyed.', '2003-08-22 02:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(395584, 33727, 5767, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm.  interesting and the bubbles add a lot.  Great composition and I really liked the lines and shapes here.</td>', 'Hmmmm.  interesting and the bubbles add a lot.  Great composition and I really liked the lines and shapes here.', '2003-08-22 02:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(395586, 33408, 5767, '<td valign="top">negative space?  can''t see how this fits the assignment, but this is an awesome "documentary" image of what is going on in the world.</td>', 'negative space?  can''t see how this fits the assignment, but this is an awesome "documentary" image of what is going on in the world.', '2003-08-22 02:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(395590, 33632, 5767, '<td valign="top">I love these trees and what they do to shed their bark.  The only comment I have is how out of focus the lower leaf it.  If it wasn''t such a large part of the image AND it wasn''t coming right out at me it wouldn''t be such a big deal.  But it really overpowers the clarity and crispness and is a big distraction.  Beautiful colors and concept and it fits with the assignment.</td>', 'I love these trees and what they do to shed their bark.  The only comment I have is how out of focus the lower leaf it.  If it wasn''t such a large part of the image AND it wasn''t coming right out at me it wouldn''t be such a big deal.  But it really overpowers the clarity and crispness and is a big distraction.  Beautiful colors and concept and it fits with the assignment.', '2003-08-22 02:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
