(396997, 33066, 3540, '<td valign="top">I think this would''ve been a more effective picture with he leaf at the bottom of the frame in lieu of the top.</td>', 'I think this would''ve been a more effective picture with he leaf at the bottom of the frame in lieu of the top.', '2003-08-23 06:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(396998, 33409, 3540, '<td valign="top">You might''ve gotten just a little closer to the subject on this one to show a little more detail.   This is excellent.   The blue part of the sky is great.  The pink part is great.  The part where they come together is banding somewhat.  very well done - 9</td>', 'You might''ve gotten just a little closer to the subject on this one to show a little more detail.   This is excellent.   The blue part of the sky is great.  The pink part is great.  The part where they come together is banding somewhat.  very well done - 9', '2003-08-23 06:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(396999, 33014, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the background is very good for this photo.  I think that it''s pretty good, but could really move up a couple notches if the background were less busy.</td>', 'I don''t think the background is very good for this photo.  I think that it''s pretty good, but could really move up a couple notches if the background were less busy.', '2003-08-23 06:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(397000, 33442, 3540, '<td valign="top">Stunning colors.  Nice crisp clear photo.  Very well done indeed 9</td>', 'Stunning colors.  Nice crisp clear photo.  Very well done indeed 9', '2003-08-23 06:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(397002, 33814, 4427, '<td valign="top">realy like the way this picture divides itself up into spaces...very nice angles and curves</td>', 'realy like the way this picture divides itself up into spaces...very nice angles and curves', '2003-08-23 06:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(397005, 33456, 4427, '<td valign="top">love the sharp angles and clear lines of the photo...so simple but so very effective in creating a sense of shape</td>', 'love the sharp angles and clear lines of the photo...so simple but so very effective in creating a sense of shape', '2003-08-23 06:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(397018, 33047, 4090, '<td valign="top">Hope this is doing well as it''s amazing, love the colours, focus, in fact everything, only one mark for you 10/10 well done</td>', 'Hope this is doing well as it''s amazing, love the colours, focus, in fact everything, only one mark for you 10/10 well done', '2003-08-23 07:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(397019, 34000, 4090, '<td valign="top">well done this is a 10/10</td>', 'well done this is a 10/10', '2003-08-23 07:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(397023, 33373, 7857, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective and unusual rotation you''ve put on this, shame its a bit small... and could maybe do with a little more sharpening? Good luck with it.</td>', 'I love the perspective and unusual rotation you''ve put on this, shame its a bit small... and could maybe do with a little more sharpening? Good luck with it.', '2003-08-23 07:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(397024, 33861, 7857, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I love the all over blue tint here - like when you delibrately use the wrong white balance. Great job, good luck.</td>', 'Great shot, I love the all over blue tint here - like when you delibrately use the wrong white balance. Great job, good luck.', '2003-08-23 07:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(397025, 33066, 7857, '<td valign="top">The only thing I dont like is that you cropped it right at the end of the leaf... maybe a bit of space between the tip and the frame would have looked better (IMO). Otherwise, nice DOF, good colour and nice work on the lighting... not too harsh here.</td>', 'The only thing I dont like is that you cropped it right at the end of the leaf... maybe a bit of space between the tip and the frame would have looked better (IMO). Otherwise, nice DOF, good colour and nice work on the lighting... not too harsh here.', '2003-08-23 07:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(397030, 33957, 11261, '<td valign="top">Wow, negative space in 3D. I like the idea behind this photograph.</td>', 'Wow, negative space in 3D. I like the idea behind this photograph.', '2003-08-23 08:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(397031, 33558, 11261, '<td valign="top">The composition of thos photo is really nice. The sky sets the mood. There''s a nice little story of ''confusion'' going on as most of the geese are traveling left and a few are traveling right, sort of a ''gathering excitement'' before the storm.</td>', 'The composition of thos photo is really nice. The sky sets the mood. There''s a nice little story of ''confusion'' going on as most of the geese are traveling left and a few are traveling right, sort of a ''gathering excitement'' before the storm.', '2003-08-23 08:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(397034, 33927, 11261, '<td valign="top">"so close I can almost taste it"! Nice tension, although the dog looks well behaved and somehow calm, but her focus is definitely on the bone. Not a photo that I could ever hope to achieve with my dogs. Great idea - all that matters to the subjects is the space between.</td>', '"so close I can almost taste it"! Nice tension, although the dog looks well behaved and somehow calm, but her focus is definitely on the bone. Not a photo that I could ever hope to achieve with my dogs. Great idea - all that matters to the subjects is the space between.', '2003-08-23 08:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(397053, 33465, 9411, '<td valign="top">Light on artistic merit, dof and the poor little guy has a bad case of red eye</td>', 'Light on artistic merit, dof and the poor little guy has a bad case of red eye', '2003-08-23 10:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(397054, 33373, 9411, '<td valign="top">Makes me dizzy, not sure which is the negative space.</td>', 'Makes me dizzy, not sure which is the negative space.', '2003-08-23 10:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(397055, 33100, 9411, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel there is really a negative space aspect to this shot.</td>', 'I don''t feel there is really a negative space aspect to this shot.', '2003-08-23 10:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(397084, 34004, 6624, '<td valign="top">I like the peach color and how it draws the eys upward</td>', 'I like the peach color and how it draws the eys upward', '2003-08-23 11:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(397085, 33952, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice water</td>', 'nice water', '2003-08-23 11:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(397102, 33852, 9146, '<td valign="top">Oh how cool!!!</td>', 'Oh how cool!!!', '2003-08-23 11:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(397150, 34025, 280, '<td valign="top">good use of shape in the negative space, but the focus seems a little soft.</td>', 'good use of shape in the negative space, but the focus seems a little soft.', '2003-08-23 13:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(397152, 34014, 280, '<td valign="top">I like the concept but the wall looks a little dirty.<br/></td>', 'I like the concept but the wall looks a little dirty.', '2003-08-23 13:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(397154, 33892, 280, '<td valign="top">The shoes look to bright and the grey area in the top right hand corner is didtracting.</td>', 'The shoes look to bright and the grey area in the top right hand corner is didtracting.', '2003-08-23 13:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(397157, 33020, 280, '<td valign="top">Colours look a little flat, maybe you could have increased the contrast slightly and reduced the brightness?</td>', 'Colours look a little flat, maybe you could have increased the contrast slightly and reduced the brightness?', '2003-08-23 13:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(397162, 33544, 280, '<td valign="top">Shame about the dull sky some clouds would have given this shot some more depth.</td>', 'Shame about the dull sky some clouds would have given this shot some more depth.', '2003-08-23 13:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(397164, 33224, 280, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to seen the balloon further off centre also, I think the yellow of the balloon would have contrasted well had the sky been left blue.<br/></td>', 'Would have liked to seen the balloon further off centre also, I think the yellow of the balloon would have contrasted well had the sky been left blue.', '2003-08-23 13:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(397198, 34000, 7711, '<td valign="top">cool shot, great focus, colour and lighting. Use of the sky as negative space is very well done as well, it really adds to the sense that this guy is flying!</td>', 'cool shot, great focus, colour and lighting. Use of the sky as negative space is very well done as well, it really adds to the sense that this guy is flying!', '2003-08-23 14:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(397201, 33502, 7711, '<td valign="top">some people may not say this is negative space because of the lines in the bricks and the shadows, but really, its space around the kid and his tattered soccerball, and I really get the feeling he''s dreaming of being the next pele or beckham. :)</td>', 'some people may not say this is negative space because of the lines in the bricks and the shadows, but really, its space around the kid and his tattered soccerball, and I really get the feeling he''s dreaming of being the next pele or beckham. :)', '2003-08-23 14:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(397203, 33927, 7711, '<td valign="top">fabulous use of negative space to create a sense of tension between the dog and the bone.</td>', 'fabulous use of negative space to create a sense of tension between the dog and the bone.', '2003-08-23 14:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(397204, 33632, 9411, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, the DOF is a bit off, and I feel the red bark is too prominent to really accentuate the negative space. My I eye travels to the foreground before noticing the back.</td>', 'Nice shot, the DOF is a bit off, and I feel the red bark is too prominent to really accentuate the negative space. My I eye travels to the foreground before noticing the back.', '2003-08-23 14:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(397207, 33319, 9411, '<td valign="top">over exposed on the right hand side this detracts from the shot, plus I find the negative space to not be the focal point</td>', 'over exposed on the right hand side this detracts from the shot, plus I find the negative space to not be the focal point', '2003-08-23 14:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(397208, 33760, 280, '<td valign="top">Love these top down shots, fantastic strong shadow. Just a shame the line between the tiles in the bottom left hand corner is stronger than the others. <br/></td>', 'Love these top down shots, fantastic strong shadow. Just a shame the line between the tiles in the bottom left hand corner is stronger than the others. ', '2003-08-23 14:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(397211, 32929, 280, '<td valign="top">Lacks any real interest and the focus on the subject seems a little soft.</td>', 'Lacks any real interest and the focus on the subject seems a little soft.', '2003-08-23 14:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(397223, 33465, 280, '<td valign="top">Could have been a better shot if it had a more suitable background also use of the flash has caused harsh lighting both on the subject and the white wall in the background. Try shooting during the day to make most use of natural light and stand the subject away from the background to make it easier to blur the background out.</td>', 'Could have been a better shot if it had a more suitable background also use of the flash has caused harsh lighting both on the subject and the white wall in the background. Try shooting during the day to make most use of natural light and stand the subject away from the background to make it easier to blur the background out.', '2003-08-23 14:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(397226, 33310, 280, '<td valign="top">What can I say? There needs to be some positive space to create a negative space.<br/></td>', 'What can I say? There needs to be some positive space to create a negative space.', '2003-08-23 14:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(397229, 33554, 280, '<td valign="top">Sorry but in my opinion the subject lacks interest and is too centrally positioned in the shot.</td>', 'Sorry but in my opinion the subject lacks interest and is too centrally positioned in the shot.', '2003-08-23 14:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(397230, 33409, 6900, '<td valign="top">One of the top 5 images of the week.  Excellent lighting - how did you manage this?  I love it.  9</td>', 'One of the top 5 images of the week.  Excellent lighting - how did you manage this?  I love it.  9', '2003-08-23 14:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(397231, 34010, 6900, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of negative space.  I like the composition and the colors.  I wish there was a bit more contrast to darken the birds a bit, but that doesn''t detract from a solid 9.</td>', 'Excellent use of negative space.  I like the composition and the colors.  I wish there was a bit more contrast to darken the birds a bit, but that doesn''t detract from a solid 9.', '2003-08-23 14:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(397232, 33319, 280, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems too harsh and the mirror looks like it should be orientated vertically not horizontally.</td>', 'Lighting seems too harsh and the mirror looks like it should be orientated vertically not horizontally.', '2003-08-23 14:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(397234, 34019, 6900, '<td valign="top">One of the best uses of non-flat negative space.  I like the image and though it''s not traditional negative space, the added sky presents a foreboding awe to the mood. 9</td>', 'One of the best uses of non-flat negative space.  I like the image and though it''s not traditional negative space, the added sky presents a foreboding awe to the mood. 9', '2003-08-23 14:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(397238, 33149, 280, '<td valign="top">The title suggests to me that these are masts of boats however it looks more like scaffolding? Also the two faint lines running horizontally across the picture are quite distracting.</td>', 'The title suggests to me that these are masts of boats however it looks more like scaffolding? Also the two faint lines running horizontally across the picture are quite distracting.', '2003-08-23 14:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(397287, 33846, 280, '<td valign="top">I have taken a similar shot to this myself [//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=5494]. From the shadows on your shot it looks like you have the sun/light behind the subject, I think it may have helped to have the sun behind the camera to reflect more light off the fleshy part of the frut to give it more colour and contrast.</td>', 'I have taken a similar shot to this myself [//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=5494]. From the shadows on your shot it looks like you have the sun/light behind the subject, I think it may have helped to have the sun behind the camera to reflect more light off the fleshy part of the frut to give it more colour and contrast.', '2003-08-23 15:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(397289, 33891, 280, '<td valign="top">The crop looks slightly too tight on the left.</td>', 'The crop looks slightly too tight on the left.', '2003-08-23 15:21:53.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(397292, 33100, 280, '<td valign="top">At first I thought the background was too busy, but the dark building stands out nicely from its lighter neighbours.</td>', 'At first I thought the background was too busy, but the dark building stands out nicely from its lighter neighbours.', '2003-08-23 15:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(397294, 33502, 280, '<td valign="top">Really nice portrait! Compositiion is superb and B&amp;W works really well in my opinion, good job.</td>', 'Really nice portrait! Compositiion is superb and B&W works really well in my opinion, good job.', '2003-08-23 15:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(397295, 33298, 280, '<td valign="top">Would have desaturated the yellows in this shot to try and remove the yellow tint from the glass. Never the less a very nice shot.</td>', 'Would have desaturated the yellows in this shot to try and remove the yellow tint from the glass. Never the less a very nice shot.', '2003-08-23 15:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(397472, 33075, 8637, '<td valign="top">Great...shows unique artistic talent and the importance of imagination in the competitions.</td>', 'Great...shows unique artistic talent and the importance of imagination in the competitions.', '2003-08-23 19:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(397473, 33310, 8637, '<td valign="top">Cute...I''m sure you''ll get blasted on votes but love the humor and the value of having fun with this challenge...you''ll probably also get more comments than anyone!</td>', 'Cute...I''m sure you''ll get blasted on votes but love the humor and the value of having fun with this challenge...you''ll probably also get more comments than anyone!', '2003-08-23 19:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(397474, 33587, 8637, '<td valign="top">Great idea...good approach for the challenge...makes me want to see more of the pool (?) though.</td>', 'Great idea...good approach for the challenge...makes me want to see more of the pool (?) though.', '2003-08-23 19:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(397476, 33727, 8637, '<td valign="top">You''ve done it again!  Super capture and anxious to see how you did this one.  Has to be a winner!</td>', 'You''ve done it again!  Super capture and anxious to see how you did this one.  Has to be a winner!', '2003-08-23 19:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(397477, 33995, 8637, '<td valign="top">very nice and excellent use of the backdrop and negative space to give depth to the light.</td>', 'very nice and excellent use of the backdrop and negative space to give depth to the light.', '2003-08-23 19:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(397514, 33310, 6008, '<td valign="top">Yup, that''s negative space all right!</td>', 'Yup, that''s negative space all right!', '2003-08-23 21:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(397518, 33820, 6008, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what this is, but I guess that''s part of the abstract. The negative space is effective, but I think I would have like more on the left, the item being partly cropped out doesnt really help the image. I do like the duotone. It has a somewhat spooky feel.</td>', 'I''m not sure what this is, but I guess that''s part of the abstract. The negative space is effective, but I think I would have like more on the left, the item being partly cropped out doesnt really help the image. I do like the duotone. It has a somewhat spooky feel.', '2003-08-23 21:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(397520, 33149, 6008, '<td valign="top">The negative space is effective, however, the horizontal lines are a little distracting, they almost remind me of folds in a piece of paper. Using grayscale I think helps with the white or ''overcast'' sky. The angled pole (or what appears to be scaffolding) makes an interesting contrast or change to the vertical poles.</td>', 'The negative space is effective, however, the horizontal lines are a little distracting, they almost remind me of folds in a piece of paper. Using grayscale I think helps with the white or ''overcast'' sky. The angled pole (or what appears to be scaffolding) makes an interesting contrast or change to the vertical poles.', '2003-08-23 21:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(397526, 33403, 6008, '<td valign="top">The shadows are a little distracting, and the rose petals appear a little soft. There is also some noise in the red, which seems to suggest that you may have used low lighting. I think more lighting, possibly from the side, would have highlighted a few of the petals in a much more dramatic way, contrasting the red petals and shadows nicely with the creamy milk.</td>', 'The shadows are a little distracting, and the rose petals appear a little soft. There is also some noise in the red, which seems to suggest that you may have used low lighting. I think more lighting, possibly from the side, would have highlighted a few of the petals in a much more dramatic way, contrasting the red petals and shadows nicely with the creamy milk.', '2003-08-23 21:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(397542, 34026, 6597, '<td valign="top">I like the colors          7</td>', 'I like the colors          7', '2003-08-23 22:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(397543, 33865, 6597, '<td valign="top">more of telephone poles would be nice  5</td>', 'more of telephone poles would be nice  5', '2003-08-23 22:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(397550, 33369, 2553, '<td valign="top">A truly lovely piece of work, and a wonderful example of negative space.</td>', 'A truly lovely piece of work, and a wonderful example of negative space.', '2003-08-23 23:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(397563, 34029, 3540, '<td valign="top">The bottom part is really cool.   I think you have too much space on top and also the sky seems to be banding or pixelating, or both.  Oversaturated?  Maybe...  Good luck.  Good shot.</td>', 'The bottom part is really cool.   I think you have too much space on top and also the sky seems to be banding or pixelating, or both.  Oversaturated?  Maybe...  Good luck.  Good shot.', '2003-08-24 00:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(397564, 33854, 3540, '<td valign="top">There is a point where there is too much Negative space.  I think this picture has reached that point.  It needs less sky and more cows.<br/></td>', 'There is a point where there is too much Negative space.  I think this picture has reached that point.  It needs less sky and more cows.', '2003-08-24 00:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(397566, 33138, 3540, '<td valign="top">Not quite as sharp as it could be.  Sky is pixelating quite a bit too.  Could be too much saturation.</td>', 'Not quite as sharp as it could be.  Sky is pixelating quite a bit too.  Could be too much saturation.', '2003-08-24 00:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(397608, 34012, 7038, '<td valign="top">One of the better ideas of the challenge.  The right head is very slightly tilted up, but that could probably be easily fixed up with some spot editing later. 9</td>', 'One of the better ideas of the challenge.  The right head is very slightly tilted up, but that could probably be easily fixed up with some spot editing later. 9', '2003-08-24 02:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(397609, 33218, 7038, '<td valign="top">I like this picture a lot.  I love the blues, and the negatice space helps set up your subject</td>', 'I like this picture a lot.  I love the blues, and the negatice space helps set up your subject', '2003-08-24 02:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(397610, 33409, 7038, '<td valign="top">I really love the colours in this one, the negative space certainly seems to be the strong point in this picture.  8</td>', 'I really love the colours in this one, the negative space certainly seems to be the strong point in this picture.  8', '2003-08-24 02:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(397624, 33629, 4090, '<td valign="top">I keep going back to this all week and I would be suprised if this don''t get a ribbon . it is amazing 10/10, love the colour and focus, compostion .. wow</td>', 'I keep going back to this all week and I would be suprised if this don''t get a ribbon . it is amazing 10/10, love the colour and focus, compostion .. wow', '2003-08-24 04:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(397652, 33218, 3540, '<td valign="top">The blue is a good idea, I don''t think I''m too crazy about the bubbles though.  I don''t think I would trust my camera underwater.  Good pic and good luck.</td>', 'The blue is a good idea, I don''t think I''m too crazy about the bubbles though.  I don''t think I would trust my camera underwater.  Good pic and good luck.', '2003-08-24 09:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(397653, 34006, 3540, '<td valign="top">This picture has some weird blue graininess going on, esp at the bottom.  Not sure what thats from.  The ball is pretty well focused.I don''t like the ball on top as well as on the bottom</td>', 'This picture has some weird blue graininess going on, esp at the bottom.  Not sure what thats from.  The ball is pretty well focused.I don''t like the ball on top as well as on the bottom', '2003-08-24 09:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(397654, 33842, 1368, '<td valign="top">Very cool!! íslensk rolla? meeeeeeeee</td>', 'Very cool!! íslensk rolla? meeeeeeeee', '2003-08-24 09:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(397656, 34016, 3540, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo!!  This IMO is way way too busy to be effective negative space.  The other big problem is that I''m not exactly sure what you were going for as a subject.  Seems to me this is a vey pretty colorful almost abstract photo.  It just doesn''t fit this challenge at all.</td>', 'Gorgeous photo!!  This IMO is way way too busy to be effective negative space.  The other big problem is that I''m not exactly sure what you were going for as a subject.  Seems to me this is a vey pretty colorful almost abstract photo.  It just doesn''t fit this challenge at all.', '2003-08-24 09:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(397657, 33629, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nicely shot subject, good DOF... though maybe a bit too shallow. I really like the way you''ve created the gradient colour background, it works very well here.</td>', 'Nicely shot subject, good DOF... though maybe a bit too shallow. I really like the way you''ve created the gradient colour background, it works very well here.', '2003-08-24 09:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(397698, 33370, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here, but I like the photo better when I scroll so that I can only see the coffee, not the light. The light doesn''t seem to add much - and the difference in brightness between it and the cup and saucer is pretty marked.</td>', 'I like the idea here, but I like the photo better when I scroll so that I can only see the coffee, not the light. The light doesn''t seem to add much - and the difference in brightness between it and the cup and saucer is pretty marked.', '2003-08-24 11:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(397700, 33587, 1202, '<td valign="top">Oh, if you could have only left out the number.  6</td>', 'Oh, if you could have only left out the number.  6', '2003-08-24 11:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(397703, 33753, 1202, '<td valign="top">NIce subject.  I feel it would have been much stronger if you had left out the tree and brought your focal point more to the front.   The blurred tombstone right in front is distracting.   6</td>', 'NIce subject.  I feel it would have been much stronger if you had left out the tree and brought your focal point more to the front.   The blurred tombstone right in front is distracting.   6', '2003-08-24 11:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(397707, 33310, 1202, '<td valign="top">If there would have been a way to get his eyes to glow, then you would have had it.  I don''t see any dead pixles either.  9</td>', 'If there would have been a way to get his eyes to glow, then you would have had it.  I don''t see any dead pixles either.  9', '2003-08-24 11:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(397717, 33066, 2000, '<td valign="top">I see what you''re trying to so here, and I like the idea.  The shadow and the leaf contrast the background - but I think it could be better executed.  The top of the pick has a green haze, and the overall background has a good bit of rainbow graining.  I don''t know what to suggest to rememdy the problem, but as it is I can''t score it as highly as I would if those problems weren''t there.</td>', 'I see what you''re trying to so here, and I like the idea.  The shadow and the leaf contrast the background - but I think it could be better executed.  The top of the pick has a green haze, and the overall background has a good bit of rainbow graining.  I don''t know what to suggest to rememdy the problem, but as it is I can''t score it as highly as I would if those problems weren''t there.', '2003-08-24 12:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(397719, 33467, 2000, '<td valign="top">Very nice... I''d suggest that, while 640 is the longest a side can be, you don''t have to use that much.  The negative space in this pic would have worked better IMO with a bit less of it.  Also, I think the sky should be a hair darker, like 10 minutes, to make the light stand out more.  However, this is a well thought out shot.</td>', 'Very nice... I''d suggest that, while 640 is the longest a side can be, you don''t have to use that much.  The negative space in this pic would have worked better IMO with a bit less of it.  Also, I think the sky should be a hair darker, like 10 minutes, to make the light stand out more.  However, this is a well thought out shot.', '2003-08-24 12:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(397724, 33948, 2000, '<td valign="top">Well thought out and executed.  I''m not sure about the border, although it does add good contrast.</td>', 'Well thought out and executed.  I''m not sure about the border, although it does add good contrast.', '2003-08-24 12:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(397725, 33224, 2000, '<td valign="top">I like the use of desaturation here - the balloon stands out well against the gray sky.  Very well executed.</td>', 'I like the use of desaturation here - the balloon stands out well against the gray sky.  Very well executed.', '2003-08-24 12:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(397727, 33955, 2000, '<td valign="top">This is the ocean, or a large pool?  The people in the background are distracting to this shot - too much background activity makes the negative space area lose its contrast with the subject.</td>', 'This is the ocean, or a large pool?  The people in the background are distracting to this shot - too much background activity makes the negative space area lose its contrast with the subject.', '2003-08-24 12:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
