(397747, 33629, 9411, '<td valign="top">One of the shots of the week, IMO.  I like the focal point, it really makes the grasshopper very much "other worldly". You can almost imagine the out of focus legs are not part of it. I might have gone for a little stronger colours in the negative space, though.</td>', 'One of the shots of the week, IMO.  I like the focal point, it really makes the grasshopper very much "other worldly". You can almost imagine the out of focus legs are not part of it. I might have gone for a little stronger colours in the negative space, though.', '2003-08-24 12:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(397749, 33252, 2000, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen a fly up close and personal like that... they really are colorful.  The capture of the colors of the fly against the background makes this shot work really well.  I think I have to give a 10 for this.</td>', 'I''ve never seen a fly up close and personal like that... they really are colorful.  The capture of the colors of the fly against the background makes this shot work really well.  I think I have to give a 10 for this.', '2003-08-24 13:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
