(398101, 33629, 9232, '<td valign="top">Good concept but a very shallow DOF.  My preference in this picture would have been to have a consistent color for the negative space instead of fading from the bright, reflective white to almost black at the top. - 5</td>', 'Good concept but a very shallow DOF.  My preference in this picture would have been to have a consistent color for the negative space instead of fading from the bright, reflective white to almost black at the top. - 5', '2003-08-24 22:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
