(398313, 33629, 9504, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo, Jacko!  Congrats...<br/> <br/>Renee</td>', 'Very cool photo, Jacko!  Congrats... Renee', '2003-08-25 01:57:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(398317, 33955, 9504, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe this ranked where it did!  I rated it a 10. I am sorry it came in 58th.  It was in my top 5.</td>', 'I can''t believe this ranked where it did!  I rated it a 10. I am sorry it came in 58th.  It was in my top 5.', '2003-08-25 02:00:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(398340, 34012, 6900, '<td valign="top">Jacko - I respect your photography as being technically 10x better than mine.  But I think you don''t/didn''t understand neg space.<br/> <br/>@everyone - I know it''s not perfectly symmetrical.  It''s me.  I tried.  I didn''t have a way to line it up, so I took a lot of shots and just kept trying.  Obviously with a cuter model or something this would have done better.<br/> <br/>Also - I had a full silhouette.  It didn''t look like a photograph, it looked like a drawing.<br/> <br/>M</td>', 'Jacko - I respect your photography as being technically 10x better than mine.  But I think you don''t/didn''t understand neg space. @everyone - I know it''s not perfectly symmetrical.  It''s me.  I tried.  I didn''t have a way to line it up, so I took a lot of shots and just kept trying.  Obviously with a cuter model or something this would have done better. Also - I had a full silhouette.  It didn''t look like a photograph, it looked like a drawing. M', '2003-08-25 02:32:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(398365, 33370, 6999, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments - yes, basically I agree that it would be better without the light, but the negative space wouldn''t be such a strong element of it without the light. Without the glare from the light that would just be a white oval.<br/> <br/>Wish I''d had time to re-shoot - I''d have lit the shade of the lamp a little too, just to give some definition. Ah well.<br/> <br/>Ed</td>', 'Thanks for the comments - yes, basically I agree that it would be better without the light, but the negative space wouldn''t be such a strong element of it without the light. Without the glare from the light that would just be a white oval. Wish I''d had time to re-shoot - I''d have lit the shade of the lamp a little too, just to give some definition. Ah well. Ed', '2003-08-25 02:56:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(398375, 34000, 1717, '<td valign="top">congratulations, Todd...awesome pic!</td>', 'congratulations, Todd...awesome pic!', '2003-08-25 03:00:49.000000', NULL, 0),
