(398407, 33583, 9911, '<td valign="top">"This is negative space for the sake of the challenge." It sure is! One of my favourites of the week. Well done!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-08-25 02:51:26.</i></td>', '"This is negative space for the sake of the challenge." It sure is! One of my favourites of the week. Well done!!', '2003-08-25 03:36:16.000000', '2003-08-25 03:51:26.000000', 0),
