(398435, 33587, 9669, '<td valign="top">For those who asked what this is... <br/>I live a couple of miles from a Mobil Refinery + fuel depot.  The tanker ships pull in to ship their fuel..  There are about 30 of these giant fuel tanks, each about 3 stories tall.   There is a similar photo in my portfolio, called <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=33588" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">oil</a></td>', 'For those who asked what this is... I live a couple of miles from a Mobil Refinery + fuel depot.  The tanker ships pull in to ship their fuel..  There are about 30 of these giant fuel tanks, each about 3 stories tall.   There is a similar photo in my portfolio, called oil', '2003-08-25 06:10:43.000000', NULL, 0),
