(398680, 33431, 1031, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by grigrigirl:</b></div><hr/><i>I purposely lightened the background to create a sense of texture and that of an old painting.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>That''s exactly the way it looked to me -- excellently done.<br/> <br/>My only tiny "complaint" is that the lightening shows up the creases in the background cloth. A piece of velvet (or maybe crushed velvet if you want more texture) would be expensive, but just maybe worth it if you wanted to re-create this shot for print.</td>', 'Originally posted by grigrigirl:I purposely lightened the background to create a sense of texture and that of an old painting. That''s exactly the way it looked to me -- excellently done. My only tiny "complaint" is that the lightening shows up the creases in the background cloth. A piece of velvet (or maybe crushed velvet if you want more texture) would be expensive, but just maybe worth it if you wanted to re-create this shot for print.', '2003-08-25 12:08:33.000000', NULL, 0),
