(398843, 33873, 1143, '<td valign="top">Sorry to see that this didn''t rank higher. It is a beautiful shot. Perhaps the bottom half is a bit too heavy. You can''t really crop from it without losing the proportion though because you wouldn''t want to crop any from the sides. Nice use of negative space. I love the colors.</td>', 'Sorry to see that this didn''t rank higher. It is a beautiful shot. Perhaps the bottom half is a bit too heavy. You can''t really crop from it without losing the proportion though because you wouldn''t want to crop any from the sides. Nice use of negative space. I love the colors.', '2003-08-25 16:04:43.000000', NULL, 0),
