(1812297, 33431, 3548, '<td valign="top">I think, Julia, that you and your work capture and embody the passion, sensuality and eroticism of New Orleans to a "T."</td>', 'I think, Julia, that you and your work capture and embody the passion, sensuality and eroticism of New Orleans to a "T."', '2005-10-25 22:59:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2028059, 33149, 30364, '<td valign="top">I like the initial ambiguity.  If it <i>were</i> on JPR''s gallery wall at a ridiculous price, almost everyone''s first-glance-from-a-distance conclusion would be to see the masts of yachts against the sky.  Perhaps to wonder, an instant later, why one of them is lying over at an alarming (for yachts) angle.  But you approach and the scene transforms into this clever romp with just a few everyday elements.  And then there''s the last laugh; the horizontal seams through what one thought of as the "sky".  It has the qualities of a really good sketch - the appearance of being unfinished, but on closer inspection it is seen to be quite complete.<br/> <br/>(edit typo)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-01-11 22:57:23.</i></td>', 'I like the initial ambiguity.  If it were on JPR''s gallery wall at a ridiculous price, almost everyone''s first-glance-from-a-distance conclusion would be to see the masts of yachts against the sky.  Perhaps to wonder, an instant later, why one of them is lying over at an alarming (for yachts) angle.  But you approach and the scene transforms into this clever romp with just a few everyday elements.  And then there''s the last laugh; the horizontal seams through what one thought of as the "sky".  It has the qualities of a really good sketch - the appearance of being unfinished, but on closer inspection it is seen to be quite complete. (edit typo)', '2006-01-11 21:12:16.000000', '2006-01-11 22:57:23.000000', 0),
(2224334, 33873, 29770, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.  Good job keeping the detail in the valley with the fog and still not blowing out the sun.</td>', 'Very nice capture.  Good job keeping the detail in the valley with the fog and still not blowing out the sun.', '2006-03-13 10:58:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2843328, 33431, 24073, '<td valign="top">An absolutely stunning piece of work! No words, just simply amazing!</td>', 'An absolutely stunning piece of work! No words, just simply amazing!', '2006-09-17 21:12:03.000000', NULL, 0),
